(3077207, 431973, 3214, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably have 50 people tell you to submit bigger next time...looks like it was a nice shot but hard to tell at this size.</td>', 'You''ll probably have 50 people tell you to submit bigger next time...looks like it was a nice shot but hard to tell at this size.', '2006-12-01 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
