(3077221, 431421, 64462, '<td valign="top">very HDR-looking image or extensively burned one. I''m not telling this is bad.</td>', 'very HDR-looking image or extensively burned one. I''m not telling this is bad.', '2006-12-01 00:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077222, 429287, 36470, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  The light is PERFECTO!!!! 9</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  The light is PERFECTO!!!! 9', '2006-12-01 00:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077223, 432322, 24528, '<td valign="top">Idnic you did it again...Nice score 10</td>', 'Idnic you did it again...Nice score 10', '2006-12-01 00:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077224, 424557, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and shadow. The focus and expression are spot on. If I could change anything, I''d have the fleece top either cropped out, or him wearing no shirt at all.  What a beautiful baby. 7</td>', 'Beautiful light and shadow. The focus and expression are spot on. If I could change anything, I''d have the fleece top either cropped out, or him wearing no shirt at all.  What a beautiful baby. 7', '2006-12-01 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077225, 430775, 7485, '<td valign="top">A striking expression and a beautiful model. Wish there were just a little more light on her eyes, and a catchlight in her left eye too.</td>', 'A striking expression and a beautiful model. Wish there were just a little more light on her eyes, and a catchlight in her left eye too.', '2006-12-01 00:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077228, 433122, 63486, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  While I can appreciate the fact that it is different than a face on shot, I think the large bushy tail is kind of strange being so large in the foreground.</td>', 'Interesting angle.  While I can appreciate the fact that it is different than a face on shot, I think the large bushy tail is kind of strange being so large in the foreground.', '2006-12-01 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077231, 432163, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the gray and charcoal tones.  I feel as if this would be really incredible if done in the portrait orientation with that wonderful grouping of clouds looming over the building. As it is, it just seems like a centered building with a pretty sky. The post editing is good and the focus as well.</td>', 'I love the gray and charcoal tones.  I feel as if this would be really incredible if done in the portrait orientation with that wonderful grouping of clouds looming over the building. As it is, it just seems like a centered building with a pretty sky. The post editing is good and the focus as well.', '2006-12-01 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077232, 433411, 40106, '<td valign="top">well thats pretty darn cool! i like the color of the sky! whts with the tilt though?</td>', 'well thats pretty darn cool! i like the color of the sky! whts with the tilt though?', '2006-12-01 00:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077236, 433369, 10818, '<td valign="top">I would imagine that was an old guard tower.  That is so cool, awesome shot.</td>', 'I would imagine that was an old guard tower.  That is so cool, awesome shot.', '2006-12-01 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077238, 431996, 63486, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Reminds me of Ansel Adams.  I think I would have liked it stepped back a little bit more with more sky in the top part of the frame, emphasizing the open-ness (is that a word?)  Good job, though.</td>', 'Interesting.  Reminds me of Ansel Adams.  I think I would have liked it stepped back a little bit more with more sky in the top part of the frame, emphasizing the open-ness (is that a word?)  Good job, though.', '2006-12-01 00:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077239, 433525, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup. Could use a contrast boost and maybe even run a dragonizer filter over it to make those details pop. Tone mapping would also help.</td>', 'Nice closeup. Could use a contrast boost and maybe even run a dragonizer filter over it to make those details pop. Tone mapping would also help.', '2006-12-01 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077241, 432989, 63486, '<td valign="top">Visually appealing, but wonder if this would have looked better in color?  I feel like a lot of detail is lost.</td>', 'Visually appealing, but wonder if this would have looked better in color?  I feel like a lot of detail is lost.', '2006-12-01 00:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077243, 433436, 40106, '<td valign="top">fabulous lighting! great dof as well! nice, visually appealing photo :) 7</td>', 'fabulous lighting! great dof as well! nice, visually appealing photo :) 7', '2006-12-01 00:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077245, 424382, 10818, '<td valign="top">I dont know how to take a good moon shot, so this get high marks from me, well done.</td>', 'I dont know how to take a good moon shot, so this get high marks from me, well done.', '2006-12-01 00:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077246, 429520, 63486, '<td valign="top">Interesting, although if you would have stepped back/zoomed out and included more of the surroundings or whatever this is I would have understood it better.</td>', 'Interesting, although if you would have stepped back/zoomed out and included more of the surroundings or whatever this is I would have understood it better.', '2006-12-01 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077247, 433190, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very crisp. The shadows are rich making the really pop.</td>', 'Very crisp. The shadows are rich making the really pop.', '2006-12-01 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077248, 428373, 61818, '<td valign="top">Holy shit, first thing I said to myself before I saw the title was ''is that Vonnegut??''.  Nice catch if that''s really him.  If it''s not, you''ve found his doplleganger.</td>', 'Holy shit, first thing I said to myself before I saw the title was ''is that Vonnegut??''.  Nice catch if that''s really him.  If it''s not, you''ve found his doplleganger.', '2006-12-01 00:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077249, 424013, 63486, '<td valign="top">Love the colors of the instrument!  The only downside of this is the pink cast on his face.  Despite this, it is quite emotive.</td>', 'Love the colors of the instrument!  The only downside of this is the pink cast on his face.  Despite this, it is quite emotive.', '2006-12-01 00:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077250, 424855, 29011, '<td valign="top">A little shabby for Tim''s budget ;) but you gotta love it, those trees!<br/>A most excellent title. I even like the shot more now. Though titling rarely has an effect on me. But it''s a good shot to match.</td>', 'A little shabby for Tim''s budget ;) but you gotta love it, those trees!A most excellent title. I even like the shot more now. Though titling rarely has an effect on me. But it''s a good shot to match.', '2006-12-01 00:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077251, 431919, 15711, '<td valign="top">Incredible post editing. I like the old sense of it with the minimal saturation of colors and the overriding brown tones. Love the title as well. Great DOF</td>', 'Incredible post editing. I like the old sense of it with the minimal saturation of colors and the overriding brown tones. Love the title as well. Great DOF', '2006-12-01 00:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077252, 432055, 63486, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seen less DOF and a sharper foreground.</td>', 'Would have liked to have seen less DOF and a sharper foreground.', '2006-12-01 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077254, 433477, 63486, '<td valign="top">Sweet girl, don''t like the shadow on the left side of her face, though.</td>', 'Sweet girl, don''t like the shadow on the left side of her face, though.', '2006-12-01 00:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077256, 427331, 40106, '<td valign="top">this is neat, i like how the poles in the water mimic the steam stacks.  nice work!</td>', 'this is neat, i like how the poles in the water mimic the steam stacks.  nice work!', '2006-12-01 00:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077258, 432978, 61818, '<td valign="top">Well hopefully it scores as well as the shot you copied that did quite well just a few challenges ago.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well hopefully it scores as well as the shot you copied that did quite well just a few challenges ago.  Good luck.', '2006-12-01 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
