(3077436, 433563, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, and a very cute little girl!<br/> <br/>The catchlights are nice, and the color is bright and vivid.  Her expression is adorable.  Very nice work.<br/> <br/>I think the lighting seems a bit harsh - maybe some light dodging above the eyes would reduce this appearance.  If those little spots around her mouth are food stains, I might have cloned them out.  If they''re freckles - I''d leave them in.  =)  It might have also looked great as a duotone, but it''s hard to desaturate those beautiful eyes.<br/> <br/>Finally, my eye seems a bit distracted by the out of focus pacifier.  It might also have been nice to see more of her cute curls.  So to this end, maybe a small aperture would have been good.<br/> <br/>Overall, nice work!  Probably not a contest winner, but a superb photo to share with the family.</td>', 'Cute shot, and a very cute little girl! The catchlights are nice, and the color is bright and vivid.  Her expression is adorable.  Very nice work. I think the lighting seems a bit harsh - maybe some light dodging above the eyes would reduce this appearance.  If those little spots around her mouth are food stains, I might have cloned them out.  If they''re freckles - I''d leave them in.  =)  It might have also looked great as a duotone, but it''s hard to desaturate those beautiful eyes. Finally, my eye seems a bit distracted by the out of focus pacifier.  It might also have been nice to see more of her cute curls.  So to this end, maybe a small aperture would have been good. Overall, nice work!  Probably not a contest winner, but a superb photo to share with the family.', '2006-12-01 00:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
