(3077480, 426217, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is definately very dramatic portrait and so true to life type shot. <br/>I can see this women, sitting in a quiet bar somewhere, or in her smoko/tea break at work. <br/>It is a very powerful, emotive image, and one we should all respect, what not to do, if we can help it. <br/>I congratulate you, and well done, on a great, dramatic, emotive portrait.....</td>', 'This is definately very dramatic portrait and so true to life type shot. I can see this women, sitting in a quiet bar somewhere, or in her smoko/tea break at work. It is a very powerful, emotive image, and one we should all respect, what not to do, if we can help it. I congratulate you, and well done, on a great, dramatic, emotive portrait.....', '2006-12-01 01:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077486, 432945, 57378, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this more if the cow had a better pose</td>', 'I think I would like this more if the cow had a better pose', '2006-12-01 01:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077489, 432322, 31637, '<td valign="top">skinny model..great lighting.</td>', 'skinny model..great lighting.', '2006-12-01 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077490, 431084, 54540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic angle - I like it.  Suggestion - a tighter crop on the subject, the bird - leaving it in the lower left, but crop tighter around it - just my two cents.  Best of luck to you in the challenge!</td>', 'Fantastic angle - I like it.  Suggestion - a tighter crop on the subject, the bird - leaving it in the lower left, but crop tighter around it - just my two cents.  Best of luck to you in the challenge!', '2006-12-01 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
