(3077511, 429957, 54540, '<td valign="top">I believe I do see what you see in this image - the colors, mixed with the fact that it looks like the fish are flying in the sky!  Very cool!  You need to take advantage of the size rule in a challenge like the Free Study though.  Again - well done on the colors and composition, but simply too small to see much.</td>', 'I believe I do see what you see in this image - the colors, mixed with the fact that it looks like the fish are flying in the sky!  Very cool!  You need to take advantage of the size rule in a challenge like the Free Study though.  Again - well done on the colors and composition, but simply too small to see much.', '2006-12-01 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077514, 432958, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a great young teen portrait, exciting lighting.  I feel sorry for this one''s father, probably already beating away the beaus.</td>', 'What a great young teen portrait, exciting lighting.  I feel sorry for this one''s father, probably already beating away the beaus.', '2006-12-01 01:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
