(3077555, 433363, 3214, '<td valign="top">I had to stare at this for a long time to finally grasp that it''s a book and those are sheets of paper "escaping".  The lengths of sheets "feel" longer than the book''s pages might be.  Interesting concept, great technicals and use of negative space.</td>', 'I had to stare at this for a long time to finally grasp that it''s a book and those are sheets of paper "escaping".  The lengths of sheets "feel" longer than the book''s pages might be.  Interesting concept, great technicals and use of negative space.', '2006-12-01 01:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
