(3077795, 433446, 66515, '<td valign="top">You may want to take a bit more time to compose for landscapes. The horizon line (at least from my point of view) is dead center. This could also use a bit of straightening. <br/> <br/>I do like the effect you created with the hills fading into the background.</td>', 'You may want to take a bit more time to compose for landscapes. The horizon line (at least from my point of view) is dead center. This could also use a bit of straightening.  I do like the effect you created with the hills fading into the background.', '2006-12-01 02:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
