(3077818, 429607, 32872, '<td valign="top">This is an OMG image.  I''m going to include it in my favorites.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is an OMG image.  I''m going to include it in my favorites.  Nice job.', '2006-12-01 03:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077822, 424695, 66192, '<td valign="top">image could use some cleaning up</td>', 'image could use some cleaning up', '2006-12-01 03:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077823, 433400, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you could have worked up the composition of this more effectively - the feather is just lying across the frame with no apparent consideration of the overall impact. Given the line/lines shape of the feather, I think you might have used that to make a strong element in frame - say, for example, a strong diagonal, and finding other elements to balance it and fill in the corners. This is a difficult kind of thing to learn though, as the ''standard rules'' only apply in such obvious ways.</td>', 'I think you could have worked up the composition of this more effectively - the feather is just lying across the frame with no apparent consideration of the overall impact. Given the line/lines shape of the feather, I think you might have used that to make a strong element in frame - say, for example, a strong diagonal, and finding other elements to balance it and fill in the corners. This is a difficult kind of thing to learn though, as the ''standard rules'' only apply in such obvious ways.', '2006-12-01 03:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077825, 429350, 32872, '<td valign="top">LoL...indeed they are!!  I love these candid street shots.</td>', 'LoL...indeed they are!!  I love these candid street shots.', '2006-12-01 03:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077831, 432092, 32872, '<td valign="top">Serene and soothing image.  I love the colors in the sky.</td>', 'Serene and soothing image.  I love the colors in the sky.', '2006-12-01 03:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077832, 433405, 6999, '<td valign="top">Difficult shot to assess - the strange light is quite interesting, but there''s something strange going on in the sky, and cutting the bottom left corner of cthe building is an odd thing to do. Filling just one corner with foreground foliage is also a touch random - it can work, but generally requires more of a full frame around the image to not look like a mistake. In the end though, it''s just a full front of a building, with, for me, not enough interest to make an impact: the strange colouring just seems like an attempt to win something back from an OK but not spectacular shot.</td>', 'Difficult shot to assess - the strange light is quite interesting, but there''s something strange going on in the sky, and cutting the bottom left corner of cthe building is an odd thing to do. Filling just one corner with foreground foliage is also a touch random - it can work, but generally requires more of a full frame around the image to not look like a mistake. In the end though, it''s just a full front of a building, with, for me, not enough interest to make an impact: the strange colouring just seems like an attempt to win something back from an OK but not spectacular shot.', '2006-12-01 03:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077836, 428970, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  How does that engine work I wonder??  Are those rings of ionized gas that drive those babies at mach speed?  Sorry...  I like the clear image against the blurred background and the detail on your jet.  Great capture.</td>', 'Nice image.  How does that engine work I wonder??  Are those rings of ionized gas that drive those babies at mach speed?  Sorry...  I like the clear image against the blurred background and the detail on your jet.  Great capture.', '2006-12-01 03:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077841, 433013, 32872, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and bubbly!</td>', 'Very pretty and bubbly!', '2006-12-01 03:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077844, 429824, 32872, '<td valign="top">Whew...nice image you have here!</td>', 'Whew...nice image you have here!', '2006-12-01 03:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077846, 424761, 6999, '<td valign="top">The blue border is horrible - it weakens the impact of the blue in the image. Compositionally though, there is some interesting stuff here. There are three obvious elements to consider - the bird, the foliage, and the white lines - and those white lines are the most immediate impact here. They might have made a useful compositional element, had you, for instance used them to balance the bird in frame, but here - where they appear to be an unconsidered background element - they just annoy the eye.</td>', 'The blue border is horrible - it weakens the impact of the blue in the image. Compositionally though, there is some interesting stuff here. There are three obvious elements to consider - the bird, the foliage, and the white lines - and those white lines are the most immediate impact here. They might have made a useful compositional element, had you, for instance used them to balance the bird in frame, but here - where they appear to be an unconsidered background element - they just annoy the eye.', '2006-12-01 03:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077850, 433213, 32872, '<td valign="top">Dang...nice detail on your bird.  He almost looks like he''s in a tux leading a symphony!  You got the shot just as his foot was skimming or about to touch the surface of the water.  Fabulous, imo.</td>', 'Dang...nice detail on your bird.  He almost looks like he''s in a tux leading a symphony!  You got the shot just as his foot was skimming or about to touch the surface of the water.  Fabulous, imo.', '2006-12-01 03:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077852, 432164, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, though the bottom right thing might effectively have been removed. The balance of elements in frame is good, but I find the brown foliage area a bit of a let-down - it adds a rather chaotic element to a clean composition.</td>', 'Nice composition, though the bottom right thing might effectively have been removed. The balance of elements in frame is good, but I find the brown foliage area a bit of a let-down - it adds a rather chaotic element to a clean composition.', '2006-12-01 03:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077857, 433537, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good light, although there are elements that make it seem over-processed - where the trees suddenly seem to lose contrast to image right, for instance. Could just be a natural weirdness of light, but it still <i>looks</i> wrong. Composition is fine.</td>', 'Good light, although there are elements that make it seem over-processed - where the trees suddenly seem to lose contrast to image right, for instance. Could just be a natural weirdness of light, but it still looks wrong. Composition is fine.', '2006-12-01 03:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077862, 424299, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get it; it''s far more interesting than the majority of pretty-pretty landscapes etc., of course, but I can''t quite see the point compositionally. The two blokes seem unrelated to other elements. The obvious connection of the three figures - simply by being figures - isn''t enough to bring an overall impact to the image, it just seems to be a statue, and some blokes laying a path. Still, it is a humnan image, a real image, which is a good thing.</td>', 'I don''t quite get it; it''s far more interesting than the majority of pretty-pretty landscapes etc., of course, but I can''t quite see the point compositionally. The two blokes seem unrelated to other elements. The obvious connection of the three figures - simply by being figures - isn''t enough to bring an overall impact to the image, it just seems to be a statue, and some blokes laying a path. Still, it is a humnan image, a real image, which is a good thing.', '2006-12-01 03:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077865, 433017, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good candid portrait, although outside of the light I don''t find it very absorbing. It seems a very disengaged image - we''re not close enough, not involved enough (in fact, the activity perhaps is just too ordinary) to be completely drawn in - and also there''s nothing, compositionally, to add punch or fascination. Still has its strong points - detail, colour, light etc.</td>', 'Good candid portrait, although outside of the light I don''t find it very absorbing. It seems a very disengaged image - we''re not close enough, not involved enough (in fact, the activity perhaps is just too ordinary) to be completely drawn in - and also there''s nothing, compositionally, to add punch or fascination. Still has its strong points - detail, colour, light etc.', '2006-12-01 03:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077867, 431832, 6999, '<td valign="top">If there were more blue, rather than purple, perhaps the reds and ambers would have more punch. Still just a pretty sky shot to me, however.</td>', 'If there were more blue, rather than purple, perhaps the reds and ambers would have more punch. Still just a pretty sky shot to me, however.', '2006-12-01 03:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077869, 429739, 6999, '<td valign="top">Flash is very heavy here - those nasty shadows from the hand and the nose could effectively be softened and produce a smoother image overall. It seems an odd pose to have chosen - either as a pose or as a chosen moment by you.</td>', 'Flash is very heavy here - those nasty shadows from the hand and the nose could effectively be softened and produce a smoother image overall. It seems an odd pose to have chosen - either as a pose or as a chosen moment by you.', '2006-12-01 03:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077873, 426108, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have them faded by using high contrast. You may have some comments about the lighting being too harsh but, I like the way this is done.</td>', 'I like the way you have them faded by using high contrast. You may have some comments about the lighting being too harsh but, I like the way this is done.', '2006-12-01 03:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077874, 433175, 6999, '<td valign="top">And ole orange frame, too. I really thing that taking a key colour into the frame makes for a very weird composition - weakening the colour in the actual image, making for a bizarre extra element that the shot surely doesn''t need. Good detail and processing and light in the actual image though, but there isn''t any real fascination to it - just a technically assured shot, without doing anything more.</td>', 'And ole orange frame, too. I really thing that taking a key colour into the frame makes for a very weird composition - weakening the colour in the actual image, making for a bizarre extra element that the shot surely doesn''t need. Good detail and processing and light in the actual image though, but there isn''t any real fascination to it - just a technically assured shot, without doing anything more.', '2006-12-01 03:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077875, 433419, 6999, '<td valign="top">Can''t get interested in this at all - the light of that direct flash reflects so strongly and harshly from the fur, and this isn''t a moment that''s at all outstanding.</td>', 'Can''t get interested in this at all - the light of that direct flash reflects so strongly and harshly from the fur, and this isn''t a moment that''s at all outstanding.', '2006-12-01 03:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077882, 424761, 33352, '<td valign="top">without the border would have been stronger, but will get the Aussie vote..7</td>', 'without the border would have been stronger, but will get the Aussie vote..7', '2006-12-01 03:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077883, 432948, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m unsure about this composition - though certainly the actual detail and focus isn''t going to work for many voters. I think the composition, mainly the background, could have been still cleaner - the black triangle removed for instance - to make more of the impact of the silhouette.</td>', 'I''m unsure about this composition - though certainly the actual detail and focus isn''t going to work for many voters. I think the composition, mainly the background, could have been still cleaner - the black triangle removed for instance - to make more of the impact of the silhouette.', '2006-12-01 03:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
