(3077988, 433416, 64773, '<td valign="top">Nice observation. There''s some slight halo artifacts (not sure the technical term) around the signs where I guess you used a mask and levels adjustment? Even then, the halo is uniform giving the image a ''plasticy'' translucent effect which adds to the message... Good job.</td>', 'Nice observation. There''s some slight halo artifacts (not sure the technical term) around the signs where I guess you used a mask and levels adjustment? Even then, the halo is uniform giving the image a ''plasticy'' translucent effect which adds to the message... Good job.', '2006-12-01 05:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
