(3078013, 432896, 64773, '<td valign="top">Oh my, I''ve got no chance in this challenge with shots like this! Amazing. The inclusion of the rocks in the foreground add a very well balanced distraction to the main reflectioin. Beautiful</td>', 'Oh my, I''ve got no chance in this challenge with shots like this! Amazing. The inclusion of the rocks in the foreground add a very well balanced distraction to the main reflectioin. Beautiful', '2006-12-01 05:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
