(3078147, 431421, 5354, '<td valign="top">Oh boy this is going to make the photo-fundementalists have a heart attack ;-)<br/>I like this post processing, it takes the image to another level, but I''m sure you are walking a very thin line with the voters. Good luck, I hope it works out well.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I would have liked to see just a little more space to the left and right of the two guys, just giving them some extra space.</td>', 'Oh boy this is going to make the photo-fundementalists have a heart attack ;-)I like this post processing, it takes the image to another level, but I''m sure you are walking a very thin line with the voters. Good luck, I hope it works out well. Compositionally, I would have liked to see just a little more space to the left and right of the two guys, just giving them some extra space.', '2006-12-01 06:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
