(3078376, 432678, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait. My fav so far.  I like the pose, the non-smile, yet pleasant expression and the angle from which you shot her. Nice. If I were to change anything, I''d remove the green inner border. I like that you included the electrical outlet to add a quirky sense to it. 8</td>', 'Terrific portrait. My fav so far.  I like the pose, the non-smile, yet pleasant expression and the angle from which you shot her. Nice. If I were to change anything, I''d remove the green inner border. I like that you included the electrical outlet to add a quirky sense to it. 8', '2006-12-01 09:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078378, 433495, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and contrast. Maybe a smidge overdone on the neat image. Her skin almost has a plastic look which is a bit unnatural. Great eyes. I like how you cropped it as well.</td>', 'Nice lighting and contrast. Maybe a smidge overdone on the neat image. Her skin almost has a plastic look which is a bit unnatural. Great eyes. I like how you cropped it as well.', '2006-12-01 09:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078382, 426963, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really powerful. I think this would be great as a black and white or sepia. I might play with levels and contrast a bit to showcase the various range of tones, since it is basically monochromatic.</td>', 'Really powerful. I think this would be great as a black and white or sepia. I might play with levels and contrast a bit to showcase the various range of tones, since it is basically monochromatic.', '2006-12-01 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078384, 433527, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity and use of diagonal line. Good focus. I might like it if you''d tilted it and made the branch even more off kilter.</td>', 'Nice simplicity and use of diagonal line. Good focus. I might like it if you''d tilted it and made the branch even more off kilter.', '2006-12-01 09:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078386, 433236, 49211, '<td valign="top">For a casual photo it has a good composition and lighting. But for a free study challenge it''s too simple.</td>', 'For a casual photo it has a good composition and lighting. But for a free study challenge it''s too simple.', '2006-12-01 09:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078387, 427799, 15711, '<td valign="top">Must be Iceland. LOL  Lovely rich tones. Love the starry sky. Nice perspective.</td>', 'Must be Iceland. LOL  Lovely rich tones. Love the starry sky. Nice perspective.', '2006-12-01 09:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078390, 429854, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the lines of the pier and roof against the irregular quality of the clouds.  Beautiful colors and reflection.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the lines of the pier and roof against the irregular quality of the clouds.  Beautiful colors and reflection.', '2006-12-01 09:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078391, 433064, 15711, '<td valign="top">I sense an ever so slight tilt to the right.  Nice reflection and long exposure.</td>', 'I sense an ever so slight tilt to the right.  Nice reflection and long exposure.', '2006-12-01 09:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078393, 428503, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for any barnyard animal. Nice natural framing with the barn door. I like the detail and coloration of the rooster. 7</td>', 'I''m a sucker for any barnyard animal. Nice natural framing with the barn door. I like the detail and coloration of the rooster. 7', '2006-12-01 09:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078395, 430591, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting study.  Would make a killer overlayer combined with another image. I like it.</td>', 'Interesting study.  Would make a killer overlayer combined with another image. I like it.', '2006-12-01 09:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078398, 424855, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the over-all mood of this image but the lines of the tree branches appear un-smooth and have a slight halo effect against the lighter sky...perhaps it''s oversharpened?</td>', 'I like the composition and the over-all mood of this image but the lines of the tree branches appear un-smooth and have a slight halo effect against the lighter sky...perhaps it''s oversharpened?', '2006-12-01 09:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078399, 425599, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice use of diagonal line. I love the rich violet and purple tones. I also like how you chose to use the portrait orientation instead of the expected landscape one.</td>', 'Nice use of diagonal line. I love the rich violet and purple tones. I also like how you chose to use the portrait orientation instead of the expected landscape one.', '2006-12-01 09:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078403, 421929, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice rich saturation of color.  I''d like if it you could back up a bit and include more of the beautiful green grass and blue cloudy sky. Love the detail and overall saturation and focus.  7</td>', 'Nice rich saturation of color.  I''d like if it you could back up a bit and include more of the beautiful green grass and blue cloudy sky. Love the detail and overall saturation and focus.  7', '2006-12-01 09:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078404, 426860, 49211, '<td valign="top">What''s the title!? Beautiful photo!</td>', 'What''s the title!? Beautiful photo!', '2006-12-01 09:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078406, 430041, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be really good in black and white as well. I like the detail and focus on her face.</td>', 'This would be really good in black and white as well. I like the detail and focus on her face.', '2006-12-01 09:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078408, 432961, 15711, '<td valign="top">I know you! Nice diagaonal sense. Makes me think of my dad, who used to be a lifeguard at Huntington Beach back in the 30''s. I like how your hoody ties into the color of the lifeguard stands. 7</td>', 'I know you! Nice diagaonal sense. Makes me think of my dad, who used to be a lifeguard at Huntington Beach back in the 30''s. I like how your hoody ties into the color of the lifeguard stands. 7', '2006-12-01 09:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078411, 426695, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the hat.  The lighting is a touch harsh on her nose and upper cheek. Great focus on her eye.</td>', 'Love the texture of the hat.  The lighting is a touch harsh on her nose and upper cheek. Great focus on her eye.', '2006-12-01 09:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078414, 433569, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very artful. I wish the lighting showcasead her face a bit more.</td>', 'Very artful. I wish the lighting showcasead her face a bit more.', '2006-12-01 09:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
