(3078423, 431748, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Good use of diagonal line. I like the contrast.  The innere shadow frame works well too. 7</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Good use of diagonal line. I like the contrast.  The innere shadow frame works well too. 7', '2006-12-01 09:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
