(3078560, 433368, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done.  It has so many "layers" yet it isn''t busy.  Love the lines of the icy water both vertical and diagonal with the icicles. The composition is excellent as well. I''m a huge fan of the square crop too. Had you cropped out part of the bottom and made it more of a rectangular shape, that would have worked too. 8</td>', 'Wonderfully done.  It has so many "layers" yet it isn''t busy.  Love the lines of the icy water both vertical and diagonal with the icicles. The composition is excellent as well. I''m a huge fan of the square crop too. Had you cropped out part of the bottom and made it more of a rectangular shape, that would have worked too. 8', '2006-12-01 10:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
