(3079459, 429638, 38198, '<td valign="top">Too small, why is it partly grayscale? That does not work so well. Lots of power lines. I think you have some good color in the trees, this is advanced editing so I would get some of the power lines out of the photo. I like the curve of the road and the white fence. If you go to learn /tutorials you will find a tutorial on how to set up your photo for dpi, you tend to get marked down a lot for small photos makes it hard to see what is up. Well good luck.</td>', 'Too small, why is it partly grayscale? That does not work so well. Lots of power lines. I think you have some good color in the trees, this is advanced editing so I would get some of the power lines out of the photo. I like the curve of the road and the white fence. If you go to learn /tutorials you will find a tutorial on how to set up your photo for dpi, you tend to get marked down a lot for small photos makes it hard to see what is up. Well good luck.', '2006-12-01 14:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
