(3079552, 428386, 38198, '<td valign="top">Nice blue eyes, good idea, but some what dull. Maybe more contrast or different crop. If you keep working with this I can see a 10 in there some where. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice blue eyes, good idea, but some what dull. Maybe more contrast or different crop. If you keep working with this I can see a 10 in there some where. Good luck.', '2006-12-01 15:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
