(3079561, 425716, 64446, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours and saturation, and angle. Very tight crop, though - I would leave few mm betwwen the car and borders.</td>', 'Excellent colours and saturation, and angle. Very tight crop, though - I would leave few mm betwwen the car and borders.', '2006-12-01 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
