(3079582, 433190, 64446, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors. I like its nuances and the transition from one to another (exception to the purple backdrop at the middle). I also like the dof and textures.</td>', 'Vibrant colors. I like its nuances and the transition from one to another (exception to the purple backdrop at the middle). I also like the dof and textures.', '2006-12-01 15:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
