(3080913, 431919, 24454, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo!  It really touches me.  Everything about the little girl is perfect.  She looks so natural, like she''s very tired from a hard day of play.  The way you have processed it compliments her and the mood of the photo perfectly!</td>', 'I LOVE this photo!  It really touches me.  Everything about the little girl is perfect.  She looks so natural, like she''s very tired from a hard day of play.  The way you have processed it compliments her and the mood of the photo perfectly!', '2006-12-02 00:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3080914, 433427, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is BEAUTIFUL!!!!  Where did you take this!  I''m in awe that you were able to get such detail in the stars when the sun is right there on the horizon.  This is so incredibly striking!  Fabulous!</td>', 'Oh this is BEAUTIFUL!!!!  Where did you take this!  I''m in awe that you were able to get such detail in the stars when the sun is right there on the horizon.  This is so incredibly striking!  Fabulous!', '2006-12-02 00:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
