(3081105, 433022, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is delicious. Love the composition and the clear focus of the silhouettes against the blue!!</td>', 'This is delicious. Love the composition and the clear focus of the silhouettes against the blue!!', '2006-12-02 05:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081106, 433554, 15711, '<td valign="top">The perfect sand dune shot.  Love the rich tonal quality!</td>', 'The perfect sand dune shot.  Love the rich tonal quality!', '2006-12-02 05:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081107, 433418, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the high key of this. Great crop. She looks like a porcelain doll. 8</td>', 'Love the high key of this. Great crop. She looks like a porcelain doll. 8', '2006-12-02 05:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081108, 433012, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute and quirkly. Great focus and lighting. She has wonderful facial structure. 8</td>', 'Cute and quirkly. Great focus and lighting. She has wonderful facial structure. 8', '2006-12-02 05:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081110, 424783, 15711, '<td valign="top">Post editing - par excellence!!! The yellow stripe amidst the otherwise monochromatic theme is perfect. Yanko? arsenal? Love the light flares.</td>', 'Post editing - par excellence!!! The yellow stripe amidst the otherwise monochromatic theme is perfect. Yanko? arsenal? Love the light flares.', '2006-12-02 05:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081111, 432876, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. I love the portrait orientation.</td>', 'Great use of negative space. I love the portrait orientation.', '2006-12-02 05:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081112, 431646, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sense of balance with the background and foreground. Love the colors and focus.</td>', 'Wonderful sense of balance with the background and foreground. Love the colors and focus.', '2006-12-02 05:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081125, 425030, 58247, '<td valign="top">I actually like this one as much as the Black and White version. That''s not usually the case with me. Good job!</td>', 'I actually like this one as much as the Black and White version. That''s not usually the case with me. Good job!', '2006-12-02 06:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081156, 428018, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I might''ve tried a portrait view to capture more of the falls, and rotated slightly counter clock-wise to level out the bridge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I might''ve tried a portrait view to capture more of the falls, and rotated slightly counter clock-wise to level out the bridge.', '2006-12-02 07:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081160, 432876, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me, what makes this image a 10 is the sign.  I''ll bet you get comments telling you you should have cloned it out.  If you do, I disagree.  This lonely island, in the middle of nowhere had a person think it was important enough to put up a sign.  As a viewer, I can imagine this sign says anything and that adds so much to the image.  Right now I''m in a humorous mood so the sign says, "No Swimming."  I love that there is just enough reflection to show me water.  And the reflection shows how the tree could have grown (the reflection is straight). I love the ''bentness'' of the tree - it grew in its own funny way even though there was seemingly no reason for it to do that, nothing impeding its growth straight up.  And its leaning towards the sign, as if for comfort.  Okay, I''m odd.  Profound is the word I keep coming up with.  I have been trying to create images that are poems.  This is one.</td>', 'For me, what makes this image a 10 is the sign.  I''ll bet you get comments telling you you should have cloned it out.  If you do, I disagree.  This lonely island, in the middle of nowhere had a person think it was important enough to put up a sign.  As a viewer, I can imagine this sign says anything and that adds so much to the image.  Right now I''m in a humorous mood so the sign says, "No Swimming."  I love that there is just enough reflection to show me water.  And the reflection shows how the tree could have grown (the reflection is straight). I love the ''bentness'' of the tree - it grew in its own funny way even though there was seemingly no reason for it to do that, nothing impeding its growth straight up.  And its leaning towards the sign, as if for comfort.  Okay, I''m odd.  Profound is the word I keep coming up with.  I have been trying to create images that are poems.  This is one.', '2006-12-02 07:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081161, 426963, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  This is a painting. This is a ten.  Hahn?</td>', 'This is beautiful.  This is a painting. This is a ten.  Hahn?', '2006-12-02 07:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081162, 433537, 12674, '<td valign="top">Brrr...makes me cold just looking at it. Nice composition and lighting contrast from background to foreground.</td>', 'Brrr...makes me cold just looking at it. Nice composition and lighting contrast from background to foreground.', '2006-12-02 07:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081165, 433252, 34192, '<td valign="top">Amazing, perfect timing.  I wonder how long you waited for this scene, how long it took to find the right business people in a hurry, to get them in the perfect position, how you found the woman and the boy so intent the world passed them by as if statues.  I like that you left the litter, that you used duotones, that you centered it perfectly and now the photographer is part of the scene.  Balance and imbalance.  Perfect. 10</td>', 'Amazing, perfect timing.  I wonder how long you waited for this scene, how long it took to find the right business people in a hurry, to get them in the perfect position, how you found the woman and the boy so intent the world passed them by as if statues.  I like that you left the litter, that you used duotones, that you centered it perfectly and now the photographer is part of the scene.  Balance and imbalance.  Perfect. 10', '2006-12-02 07:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081168, 432902, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent timing sharpness and clarity.  But you knew that. :)</td>', 'excellent timing sharpness and clarity.  But you knew that. :)', '2006-12-02 07:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081169, 431681, 34192, '<td valign="top">Object as art - this is a beautiful piece of art.  You''ve rendered it perfectly. 10</td>', 'Object as art - this is a beautiful piece of art.  You''ve rendered it perfectly. 10', '2006-12-02 07:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081171, 426415, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot - very neat arches. With the advanced editing rules, I might''ve cloned out the light area (road?) toward the bottom.  It competes every so slightly with the bridge.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot - very neat arches. With the advanced editing rules, I might''ve cloned out the light area (road?) toward the bottom.  It competes every so slightly with the bridge.', '2006-12-02 07:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081172, 430899, 34192, '<td valign="top">I see Kandinsky, Motherwell, Pollack all combined to make a fascinating image that transcends the genre.  I could hang it on my wall.  For some reason I keep coming back in my head to butchershop - the red splash is probably doing it and the title reference to countertop.  Beautiful find and great eye. 10</td>', 'I see Kandinsky, Motherwell, Pollack all combined to make a fascinating image that transcends the genre.  I could hang it on my wall.  For some reason I keep coming back in my head to butchershop - the red splash is probably doing it and the title reference to countertop.  Beautiful find and great eye. 10', '2006-12-02 07:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081173, 433363, 34192, '<td valign="top">Something ethereal about this.  I find this image fascinating.  So simple and so profound when taking the title into consideration. 10</td>', 'Something ethereal about this.  I find this image fascinating.  So simple and so profound when taking the title into consideration. 10', '2006-12-02 07:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081174, 432766, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice job isolating bird from feeder against non-competing background.  Neat shot.</td>', 'Nice job isolating bird from feeder against non-competing background.  Neat shot.', '2006-12-02 07:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081175, 426217, 12674, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice composition and lighting.', '2006-12-02 07:33:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3081178, 433032, 34192, '<td valign="top">But I don''t want to give you an 8.  I want to give you a 9.  But the power of suggestion is so strong...  On my monitor the hands are slightly blown, or you intended it that way (not something I would mark down for, just an observation).  I like the collage feel of this. 9</td>', 'But I don''t want to give you an 8.  I want to give you a 9.  But the power of suggestion is so strong...  On my monitor the hands are slightly blown, or you intended it that way (not something I would mark down for, just an observation).  I like the collage feel of this. 9', '2006-12-02 07:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081183, 427248, 12674, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a lot with very little.  A little sketch-like, but I like it.</td>', 'You''ve done a lot with very little.  A little sketch-like, but I like it.', '2006-12-02 07:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081184, 429064, 34192, '<td valign="top">I typically don''t care for hyper-saturated landscapes but this one speaks to me.  You''ve composed perfectly - that single tall spike is perfectly placed.  The repetition of color and shape really give this a sense of movement - I can almost see the wind blow. excellent work! 9</td>', 'I typically don''t care for hyper-saturated landscapes but this one speaks to me.  You''ve composed perfectly - that single tall spike is perfectly placed.  The repetition of color and shape really give this a sense of movement - I can almost see the wind blow. excellent work! 9', '2006-12-02 07:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081187, 433531, 12674, '<td valign="top">I can''t see enough to understand what shot is about.  From title, I''m guessing it''s a negative of a small stream.</td>', 'I can''t see enough to understand what shot is about.  From title, I''m guessing it''s a negative of a small stream.', '2006-12-02 07:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081188, 425030, 34192, '<td valign="top">Somehow I feel I''ve seen this before. ;)  Love the color tones here - sets up the white perfectly.</td>', 'Somehow I feel I''ve seen this before. ;)  Love the color tones here - sets up the white perfectly.', '2006-12-02 07:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081190, 431695, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent architecture shot - probably the best in the challenge.  DOF is perfect.  Love the color tones and composition.</td>', 'Excellent architecture shot - probably the best in the challenge.  DOF is perfect.  Love the color tones and composition.', '2006-12-02 07:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081191, 432818, 34192, '<td valign="top">What I find amusing about this image is the modern steel safety rail next to a grass and gravel road in a rural seeming area.  Your tones are excellent.  Title a little weak.  The shadow adds to the depth of the image.  excellent find! 9</td>', 'What I find amusing about this image is the modern steel safety rail next to a grass and gravel road in a rural seeming area.  Your tones are excellent.  Title a little weak.  The shadow adds to the depth of the image.  excellent find! 9', '2006-12-02 07:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081193, 432989, 34192, '<td valign="top">What makes this image for me is the duotone you used.  Wouldn''t work in black or brown but works perfectly with this.  Excellent sharpness and detail, good composition. 8</td>', 'What makes this image for me is the duotone you used.  Wouldn''t work in black or brown but works perfectly with this.  Excellent sharpness and detail, good composition. 8', '2006-12-02 07:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081199, 428673, 66060, '<td valign="top">Bear_Music, is that you? :)</td>', 'Bear_Music, is that you? :)', '2006-12-02 07:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081200, 431286, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this in its simplicity.  The DOF and the lighting are great.  I hate that many will just see an apple, that they will think you don''t understand lighting.  You could have shot it with a black or white background (hey, I do it all the time) but for me, this set up is much more interesting, as if this apple is in a real space and a real time.  Hope that makes sense.  You have just taught me something; maybe made me remember is a better statement. And for that lesson, I have to give you a 10.  And a fav so next time I forget I can be reminded.</td>', 'I love this in its simplicity.  The DOF and the lighting are great.  I hate that many will just see an apple, that they will think you don''t understand lighting.  You could have shot it with a black or white background (hey, I do it all the time) but for me, this set up is much more interesting, as if this apple is in a real space and a real time.  Hope that makes sense.  You have just taught me something; maybe made me remember is a better statement. And for that lesson, I have to give you a 10.  And a fav so next time I forget I can be reminded.', '2006-12-02 07:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081201, 424231, 34192, '<td valign="top">The expression is priceless and the DOF amplifies it.  Excellent capture! 9</td>', 'The expression is priceless and the DOF amplifies it.  Excellent capture! 9', '2006-12-02 07:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081202, 428672, 34192, '<td valign="top">A simple, beautiful study.  Lighting and color is great.  DOF and composition perfect. 8</td>', 'A simple, beautiful study.  Lighting and color is great.  DOF and composition perfect. 8', '2006-12-02 07:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081203, 433442, 66060, '<td valign="top">Outtake from the Bond challenge? :)</td>', 'Outtake from the Bond challenge? :)', '2006-12-02 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081204, 426217, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Wouldn''t have the same impact if she were looking at the camera.  The shape of her face goes perfectly with her backswept hair.  The tones are excellent.  Great work! 9</td>', 'I love this.  Wouldn''t have the same impact if she were looking at the camera.  The shape of her face goes perfectly with her backswept hair.  The tones are excellent.  Great work! 9', '2006-12-02 07:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081216, 430690, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Contrast seems a little low.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Contrast seems a little low.', '2006-12-02 08:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081220, 429638, 34192, '<td valign="top">Image is too small to really see anything.</td>', 'Image is too small to really see anything.', '2006-12-02 08:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
