(3081283, 432987, 34192, '<td valign="top">very soft.  not sharpness soft, tactile soft, which works well with the subject.  Like the rendering of the colors as pastels, also works with whole mood of image.  Composition well done as is DOF.  7</td>', 'very soft.  not sharpness soft, tactile soft, which works well with the subject.  Like the rendering of the colors as pastels, also works with whole mood of image.  Composition well done as is DOF.  7', '2006-12-02 09:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
