(3081434, 424855, 34192, '<td valign="top">It is rather amusing.  I bet those trees were planted the same time the house was built.  Composition works for me.  Like the colors.  Top 1/3 not interested but at the same time, needed. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'It is rather amusing.  I bet those trees were planted the same time the house was built.  Composition works for me.  Like the colors.  Top 1/3 not interested but at the same time, needed. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-02 11:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
