(3081439, 433246, 37719, '<td valign="top">"6" - Was just reviewing the comments I had made and noticed this one.  Very uncharacteristic for me.  I never leave numbers - I didn''t even vote on this challenge.  So:<br/> <br/>I love the composition of the scene.  The angle of approach really lends itself very well to the reflections - well done!  The close crop really works well with this composition as well.  The balance between subject area and negative space is really well proportioned.  The colors seem a bit washed out on the top decks, but the tonal range in the lower half and the reflections is very pleasing.  Overall an interesting shot with a lot of good qualities.  The only distraction I find is all the antennas/masts on the same horizontal as the subject cabins.  Perhaps a bit of darkening to lessen their presence.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-19 13:33:35.</i></td>', '"6" - Was just reviewing the comments I had made and noticed this one.  Very uncharacteristic for me.  I never leave numbers - I didn''t even vote on this challenge.  So: I love the composition of the scene.  The angle of approach really lends itself very well to the reflections - well done!  The close crop really works well with this composition as well.  The balance between subject area and negative space is really well proportioned.  The colors seem a bit washed out on the top decks, but the tonal range in the lower half and the reflections is very pleasing.  Overall an interesting shot with a lot of good qualities.  The only distraction I find is all the antennas/masts on the same horizontal as the subject cabins.  Perhaps a bit of darkening to lessen their presence.', '2006-12-02 11:42:17.000000', '2006-12-19 13:33:35.000000', 1),
(3081441, 433199, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent timing.  Excellent sharpness considering subject is moving fast. :)  Composition works but not sure if I want more duck head or less duck head. 7 good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'excellent timing.  Excellent sharpness considering subject is moving fast. :)  Composition works but not sure if I want more duck head or less duck head. 7 good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-02 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081442, 428701, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful black and white tones.  Composed very well - DOF excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'beautiful black and white tones.  Composed very well - DOF excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-02 11:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081443, 433418, 34192, '<td valign="top">crop works for me.  lack of detial in face works for me also - enough texture is provided in hair and background to make up for it.  DOF perfect for image. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'crop works for me.  lack of detial in face works for me also - enough texture is provided in hair and background to make up for it.  DOF perfect for image. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-02 11:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081447, 430775, 34192, '<td valign="top">love the toning - works very well with subject.  dof perfect.  composition excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'love the toning - works very well with subject.  dof perfect.  composition excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-02 11:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081461, 432683, 15711, '<td valign="top">A classic stormy vista.  Lovely rich tones of blue-gray, green and orangey yellow.  Not overdone.  Quite lovely. If I could have made it "perfect" for me, I''d have had a horse, or cow or some grazing sheep in the meadow.  Really a beautiful image. It could work, using the portrait orientation as well, with that looming sky as the predominant feature. Bumping up. 8</td>', 'A classic stormy vista.  Lovely rich tones of blue-gray, green and orangey yellow.  Not overdone.  Quite lovely. If I could have made it "perfect" for me, I''d have had a horse, or cow or some grazing sheep in the meadow.  Really a beautiful image. It could work, using the portrait orientation as well, with that looming sky as the predominant feature. Bumping up. 8', '2006-12-02 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081464, 429852, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - a classic. That drop of spiddle on the chin just makes it for me. Love the texture and tonality.  The lighting is perfect. Bumping up. 8</td>', 'HEE HEE - a classic. That drop of spiddle on the chin just makes it for me. Love the texture and tonality.  The lighting is perfect. Bumping up. 8', '2006-12-02 11:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081467, 427248, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something about this I like. It''s simple and something we can all relate to.  The vantage point and the composition are perfect.  That hint of blue in the can really makes it for me.</td>', 'Something about this I like. It''s simple and something we can all relate to.  The vantage point and the composition are perfect.  That hint of blue in the can really makes it for me.', '2006-12-02 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081469, 433384, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely in tonal quality. 7</td>', 'Simple and lovely in tonal quality. 7', '2006-12-02 11:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081470, 433020, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times. I really like the perspective and the diagonal line of the grasses blowing in the wind. I like the duotone coloration with that hint of blue.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times. I really like the perspective and the diagonal line of the grasses blowing in the wind. I like the duotone coloration with that hint of blue.', '2006-12-02 11:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081477, 433474, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and velvety colors.  It seems a touch chopped off in the foreground. I almost wish that we had the whole view of the grasses. I love silhouettes. 7</td>', 'Nice perspective and velvety colors.  It seems a touch chopped off in the foreground. I almost wish that we had the whole view of the grasses. I love silhouettes. 7', '2006-12-02 12:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081480, 433550, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. She has an earnest smile and it''s not cheesy.  Beautiful eyes. The tonality is great with nice lighting.  Maybe a smidge harsh on the cheeks and nose, but no points off for that. She''s lovely. 7</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. She has an earnest smile and it''s not cheesy.  Beautiful eyes. The tonality is great with nice lighting.  Maybe a smidge harsh on the cheeks and nose, but no points off for that. She''s lovely. 7', '2006-12-02 12:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081488, 432925, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I love the reflection. Her feet and right hand seem a bit "hard" - I''d like them more relaxed like her left hand is. The minimal saturation of color works nicely.</td>', 'Interesting. I love the reflection. Her feet and right hand seem a bit "hard" - I''d like them more relaxed like her left hand is. The minimal saturation of color works nicely.', '2006-12-02 12:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081492, 422980, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love how the area around the leaf is darker and pulls your eye right to it.  Lovely detail yet naturally done.  Bumping up. I''m a total sucker for a leaf image. I''d hang this on my wall. 8</td>', 'I love how the area around the leaf is darker and pulls your eye right to it.  Lovely detail yet naturally done.  Bumping up. I''m a total sucker for a leaf image. I''d hang this on my wall. 8', '2006-12-02 12:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081500, 433459, 15711, '<td valign="top">The bird really sends this image over the top - like a little gift to the image. I might play with contrast just a smidge, but the composition is perfect. 7</td>', 'The bird really sends this image over the top - like a little gift to the image. I might play with contrast just a smidge, but the composition is perfect. 7', '2006-12-02 12:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081502, 424969, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like that he''s wearing glasses and has a print shirt. It works since the background is just slightly textured.  Good DOF. Bumping up.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like that he''s wearing glasses and has a print shirt. It works since the background is just slightly textured.  Good DOF. Bumping up.', '2006-12-02 12:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081537, 433416, 45115, '<td valign="top">YES!!!! excellent advice!!!!!!!!</td>', 'YES!!!! excellent advice!!!!!!!!', '2006-12-02 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
