(3081710, 433052, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and wonderful expression. The pink on black makes this one really jump out at you. Great shot.</td>', 'Great lighting and wonderful expression. The pink on black makes this one really jump out at you. Great shot.', '2006-12-02 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081713, 433204, 54540, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and deep depth of field in this image.  Good angle.  The title leads me to think that I might get a glimpse of some part of this persons life, so I wish that there were some additional things to look at to know more about this person - for example, what''s in the bag?<br/>Good entry and good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I like the perspective and deep depth of field in this image.  Good angle.  The title leads me to think that I might get a glimpse of some part of this persons life, so I wish that there were some additional things to look at to know more about this person - for example, what''s in the bag?Good entry and good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-02 13:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081730, 433368, 65603, '<td valign="top">Brrr!! I think the lack of light affects the picture. I find it hard to tell the foreground landscape and and a little more light would have brought you "iceburg" lol to more attention. Good shot otherwise.</td>', 'Brrr!! I think the lack of light affects the picture. I find it hard to tell the foreground landscape and and a little more light would have brought you "iceburg" lol to more attention. Good shot otherwise.', '2006-12-02 13:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
