(3083211, 433449, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of those scenes that is much better in person.  The row of bushes really keep me from enjoying the slopes.  I also can''t put anything in context - the hills could be 20 feet high or 2000 feet high - I really can''t tell from this image.  Detail is nice.</td>', 'I think this is one of those scenes that is much better in person.  The row of bushes really keep me from enjoying the slopes.  I also can''t put anything in context - the hills could be 20 feet high or 2000 feet high - I really can''t tell from this image.  Detail is nice.', '2006-12-03 10:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
