(3083317, 424761, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m suffering from border disorder. OUCH! I generally like a tasteful border but this one doesn''t seem to being doing anything positive for the image. I really like the composition and the exposure is right on. I think the image could use more contrast to better accentuate those beautiful feathers again those curly leaves. Good Luck!</td>', 'I''m suffering from border disorder. OUCH! I generally like a tasteful border but this one doesn''t seem to being doing anything positive for the image. I really like the composition and the exposure is right on. I think the image could use more contrast to better accentuate those beautiful feathers again those curly leaves. Good Luck!', '2006-12-03 11:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083333, 431768, 32767, '<td valign="top">I love everything except the crop. Just an opinion but I think you could have gotten in tighter and maybe even cropped off the top of her hair maybe a 1/3 of the way and the sides a dash. Good Luck!</td>', 'I love everything except the crop. Just an opinion but I think you could have gotten in tighter and maybe even cropped off the top of her hair maybe a 1/3 of the way and the sides a dash. Good Luck!', '2006-12-03 11:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
