(3084577, 429142, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the "idea" was great, however the execution could have been improved. It is a difficult shot (to keep the crowd steady with the long exposure). Still I am giving an above average rating for the concept.</td>', 'I think the "idea" was great, however the execution could have been improved. It is a difficult shot (to keep the crowd steady with the long exposure). Still I am giving an above average rating for the concept.', '2006-12-03 21:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
