(3084584, 431651, 62318, '<td valign="top">Fun portrait, would have been much improved if the subject was looking at the camera and a bit more depth to get the guitar sharp.. Average rating.</td>', 'Fun portrait, would have been much improved if the subject was looking at the camera and a bit more depth to get the guitar sharp.. Average rating.', '2006-12-03 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
