(3086456, 433168, 35994, '<td valign="top">For me the angle seems a little ackward, maybe try rotating it 90 degrees? (just my 2 cents)<br/>Very sad image, but you''ve managed to catch the beauty of the whale with the lighting/reflections on the skin. Good shot</td>', 'For me the angle seems a little ackward, maybe try rotating it 90 degrees? (just my 2 cents)Very sad image, but you''ve managed to catch the beauty of the whale with the lighting/reflections on the skin. Good shot', '2006-12-04 12:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
