(3086546, 431546, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the haphazard nature of this, but could live without the Santa on the wall.  Or put it on the other side, maybe.  Where it is makes the picture seem unbalanced.  The looks, however, are priceless!  And I love dad without the pants... too funny!</td>', 'I really like the haphazard nature of this, but could live without the Santa on the wall.  Or put it on the other side, maybe.  Where it is makes the picture seem unbalanced.  The looks, however, are priceless!  And I love dad without the pants... too funny!', '2006-12-04 13:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
