(3086689, 431788, 42100, '<td valign="top">Fantastic exposure, the color tones are awesome.  The composition is strong and dynamic as well.  Great job!</td>', 'Fantastic exposure, the color tones are awesome.  The composition is strong and dynamic as well.  Great job!', '2006-12-04 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
