(3086758, 433220, 64929, '<td valign="top">This perspective shot is just tooooo dang cool!  Makes me want to look at it again and again....Bravo! *bump*</td>', 'This perspective shot is just tooooo dang cool!  Makes me want to look at it again and again....Bravo! *bump*', '2006-12-04 14:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
