(3087089, 433190, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is so vibrant and 3-dimensional!   I love those brilliant reds outlining those baby blues and greens.   And of course, I''m always drawn to these very close-up crops!  Really great job!</td>', 'Wow!  This is so vibrant and 3-dimensional!   I love those brilliant reds outlining those baby blues and greens.   And of course, I''m always drawn to these very close-up crops!  Really great job!', '2006-12-04 16:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
