(3087611, 425030, 7485, '<td valign="top">Superb composition, great sense of depth, nice color-contrast, and very well edited. You have some quite noticeable artifacts which are probably from a combination of over-sharpening and over-compression (your file is 132KB, those extra 18KB would have helped). But all in all a very good image that will undoubtedly do well - 8</td>', 'Superb composition, great sense of depth, nice color-contrast, and very well edited. You have some quite noticeable artifacts which are probably from a combination of over-sharpening and over-compression (your file is 132KB, those extra 18KB would have helped). But all in all a very good image that will undoubtedly do well - 8', '2006-12-04 21:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
