(3088394, 429638, 18207, '<td valign="top">You probably heard this before: it''s small, the sky is burnt out, the wires are disturbing, it misses color on the trees. 2 because the curved road with the opening between the trees, as a theme, is not that bad.</td>', 'You probably heard this before: it''s small, the sky is burnt out, the wires are disturbing, it misses color on the trees. 2 because the curved road with the opening between the trees, as a theme, is not that bad.', '2006-12-05 06:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088396, 432990, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, like the silhouette, just think the composition could have been better thought out, think the foreground is too much and the sun in dead center like that, think I would have liked it better had you had more sky and less foreground or possibly in a panorama.</td>', 'Not bad, like the silhouette, just think the composition could have been better thought out, think the foreground is too much and the sun in dead center like that, think I would have liked it better had you had more sky and less foreground or possibly in a panorama.', '2006-12-05 06:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088397, 428386, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, just seems to me that the eyes are just off focus, maybe it´s just that you forgot to sharpen after resizing but it´s hurting the shot ever so slightly.  Still dig it and gave a 6.</td>', 'I like the lighting, just seems to me that the eyes are just off focus, maybe it´s just that you forgot to sharpen after resizing but it´s hurting the shot ever so slightly.  Still dig it and gave a 6.', '2006-12-05 06:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088399, 433411, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the shot, would have liked it better ifyou would have corrected the left downward tilt though, hurts the shot a little.</td>', 'Nice colors in the shot, would have liked it better ifyou would have corrected the left downward tilt though, hurts the shot a little.', '2006-12-05 06:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088401, 433495, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, dig the sepia toning, great image in my books, however skin seems a little too perfect and has somewhat of an overprocessed feel to it but nothing I let affect my vote.</td>', 'Nice shot, dig the sepia toning, great image in my books, however skin seems a little too perfect and has somewhat of an overprocessed feel to it but nothing I let affect my vote.', '2006-12-05 06:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088403, 432956, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but whatever was done to this image really doesn´t agree with me, wether it´s due to lighting or some post processing effect, I don´t like the outcome, mainly the odd coloring and the lack of texture.  I voted this shot a 3 and thought you at least deserved to know why.</td>', 'Sorry but whatever was done to this image really doesn´t agree with me, wether it´s due to lighting or some post processing effect, I don´t like the outcome, mainly the odd coloring and the lack of texture.  I voted this shot a 3 and thought you at least deserved to know why.', '2006-12-05 06:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088406, 433561, 27482, '<td valign="top">Think you could have done a better job in blurring out the water and sky, it bleeds over the boat just a little and also there is a very wierd artefacting going on around the name of the boat and the anchor so I encourage to take more care in post processing in the future.  Other than that though, this shot is nice and got great colors in it, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Think you could have done a better job in blurring out the water and sky, it bleeds over the boat just a little and also there is a very wierd artefacting going on around the name of the boat and the anchor so I encourage to take more care in post processing in the future.  Other than that though, this shot is nice and got great colors in it, gave it a 6.', '2006-12-05 06:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088408, 433169, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really digging the fisheye effect on this shot to be honest but lighting seems ok and good colors.  5 from me.</td>', 'Not really digging the fisheye effect on this shot to be honest but lighting seems ok and good colors.  5 from me.', '2006-12-05 06:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088409, 433540, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really dig this shot with the exception it´s a little too dark for my taste, had the lower half been a little brighter I would have voted a bit higher but as it is it still got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I really dig this shot with the exception it´s a little too dark for my taste, had the lower half been a little brighter I would have voted a bit higher but as it is it still got a 7 from me.', '2006-12-05 06:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088413, 432388, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but this seems to me (I emphasize the word "seems") to be a snapshot, just doesn´t seem very well thought out compositionally as it appears to be taken from eye height and not really has anything that draws out an interesting angle of the subject/s.  Next time I urge you to try something a bit more dramatic, like take the shot from a lower vantage point or higher or a closeup.  I voted 4 on this and expect you to do better next time :D</td>', 'I am sorry but this seems to me (I emphasize the word "seems") to be a snapshot, just doesn´t seem very well thought out compositionally as it appears to be taken from eye height and not really has anything that draws out an interesting angle of the subject/s.  Next time I urge you to try something a bit more dramatic, like take the shot from a lower vantage point or higher or a closeup.  I voted 4 on this and expect you to do better next time :D', '2006-12-05 06:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088415, 433276, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but I would have voted higher if image wasn´t so flat, would dramatically improve it to have higher contrast.</td>', 'Not bad but I would have voted higher if image wasn´t so flat, would dramatically improve it to have higher contrast.', '2006-12-05 06:39:16.000000', NULL, 1);
