(3088421, 432978, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm..........  Jason or Zoomdak?  Or even Librodo (took a similar shot in a challenge this summer but doubt he traveled to Oregon to do it again, hehe)  Anyway, nice shot but I have seen better from all 3 of you if it is one of you but still good enough for a 7 from me and I´m picky.</td>', 'Hmmmm..........  Jason or Zoomdak?  Or even Librodo (took a similar shot in a challenge this summer but doubt he traveled to Oregon to do it again, hehe)  Anyway, nice shot but I have seen better from all 3 of you if it is one of you but still good enough for a 7 from me and I´m picky.', '2006-12-05 06:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088423, 426873, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nothing I haven´t seen before but well executed so I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Nothing I haven´t seen before but well executed so I gave it a 6.', '2006-12-05 06:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088425, 433498, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, like the moment and framing but seems way oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Not bad, like the moment and framing but seems way oversharpened to me.', '2006-12-05 06:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088427, 433092, 27482, '<td valign="top">No offense but in a challenge like this, this kindof will get lost in between a lot of great entries, you need to try harder but not a bad shot at all though so I gave it a 5.</td>', 'No offense but in a challenge like this, this kindof will get lost in between a lot of great entries, you need to try harder but not a bad shot at all though so I gave it a 5.', '2006-12-05 06:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088430, 433416, 27482, '<td valign="top">Think you could have done a better job with the post processing, the strong halo around everything in this shot really bothers me and made me knock off a couple of points, sorry but I voted this a 4.</td>', 'Think you could have done a better job with the post processing, the strong halo around everything in this shot really bothers me and made me knock off a couple of points, sorry but I voted this a 4.', '2006-12-05 06:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088434, 433190, 27482, '<td valign="top">Get the impression this is a Sherryl image, nice work, you are getting better at lighting these shots if it is indeed you.  Really dig the lighting and texture in this shot but others I have seen have better composition and leading lines in other shots from you, if you combined this with better composition, you´d have a killer shot :)  7</td>', 'Get the impression this is a Sherryl image, nice work, you are getting better at lighting these shots if it is indeed you.  Really dig the lighting and texture in this shot but others I have seen have better composition and leading lines in other shots from you, if you combined this with better composition, you´d have a killer shot :)  7', '2006-12-05 06:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088436, 432866, 27482, '<td valign="top">Best sunset shot so far inthe challenge, nothing really that is blowing me away though but worthy of a 7 from me.</td>', 'Best sunset shot so far inthe challenge, nothing really that is blowing me away though but worthy of a 7 from me.', '2006-12-05 06:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088437, 424855, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, I like that the best about this shot but great colors too, 7 from me.</td>', 'Very well composed, I like that the best about this shot but great colors too, 7 from me.', '2006-12-05 06:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088439, 432939, 27482, '<td valign="top">Image seems a bit flat, a bit more contrast would definately make it "pop" more.</td>', 'Image seems a bit flat, a bit more contrast would definately make it "pop" more.', '2006-12-05 06:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088441, 431935, 27482, '<td valign="top">B/W conversion is nice enough but I can´t help but wonder if I wouldn´t have liked it better in color.  Nice shot though, 6 from me.</td>', 'B/W conversion is nice enough but I can´t help but wonder if I wouldn´t have liked it better in color.  Nice shot though, 6 from me.', '2006-12-05 06:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
