(3088603, 431647, 60614, '<td valign="top">Love the cute plump penguins.  The composition and lighting is very nice.  Especially like how the tires from the top guide you in a flowing motion to the penguins on the lower rock.  The greyish green tone of the rocks makes the penguins stand out even more.  Love the punk hairdo of the one on the left.  Hope this one does well.</td>', 'Love the cute plump penguins.  The composition and lighting is very nice.  Especially like how the tires from the top guide you in a flowing motion to the penguins on the lower rock.  The greyish green tone of the rocks makes the penguins stand out even more.  Love the punk hairdo of the one on the left.  Hope this one does well.', '2006-12-05 08:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088605, 432902, 60614, '<td valign="top">Try oobing this one.  Great composition and focus.</td>', 'Try oobing this one.  Great composition and focus.', '2006-12-05 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3088608, 433081, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better action shots I have seen in awhile.  I would love to know how you got such a great indoor shot.  I am always trying to take pictures of my kids backetball games but can''t seem to get them to come out.  The color and focus is great.</td>', 'This is one of the better action shots I have seen in awhile.  I would love to know how you got such a great indoor shot.  I am always trying to take pictures of my kids backetball games but can''t seem to get them to come out.  The color and focus is great.', '2006-12-05 09:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
