(3089892, 433438, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Too bad the focus on the sparrow wasn''t sharper. The red seems to be a little too intense. On my monitor, the bird appears to have more red than brown in the head, wings, and tail. The bokeh is very nice.</td>', 'Nice catch. Too bad the focus on the sparrow wasn''t sharper. The red seems to be a little too intense. On my monitor, the bird appears to have more red than brown in the head, wings, and tail. The bokeh is very nice.', '2006-12-05 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
