(3089993, 431973, 66384, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really nice photo, but it is too small to see any detail. If you change the dpi to 72 and the image size to 640 pixels high, it will be a good size for judging.</td>', 'This looks like a really nice photo, but it is too small to see any detail. If you change the dpi to 72 and the image size to 640 pixels high, it will be a good size for judging.', '2006-12-05 18:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
