(3089998, 433538, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in the water - the marvellous deformation of them from the ripples; a pity, perhaps, that they couldn''t be more in focus, to make this less of a simple portrait of the bird.</td>', 'I like the lines in the water - the marvellous deformation of them from the ripples; a pity, perhaps, that they couldn''t be more in focus, to make this less of a simple portrait of the bird.', '2006-12-05 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
