(3093051, 421647, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty good shot, but why shoot a picture of a toy?  Just curious.  I do like the out of focus thing in the foreground and the lighting is good.</td>', 'It''s a pretty good shot, but why shoot a picture of a toy?  Just curious.  I do like the out of focus thing in the foreground and the lighting is good.', '2006-12-06 13:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093052, 433305, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Thank you for disregarding scores and putting such beauty into a challenge. 10</td>', 'Stunning. Thank you for disregarding scores and putting such beauty into a challenge. 10', '2006-12-06 13:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093057, 424013, 50695, '<td valign="top">I knew he wasn''t dead!</td>', 'I knew he wasn''t dead!', '2006-12-06 13:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093059, 424855, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice title, but you''re missing an apostrophe.  Don''t you hate when people leave comments like this?  I do very much like the dead-center composition.  May be just a *wee* bit oversharpened in the tree branches but the look kinda fits the picture.</td>', 'Nice title, but you''re missing an apostrophe.  Don''t you hate when people leave comments like this?  I do very much like the dead-center composition.  May be just a *wee* bit oversharpened in the tree branches but the look kinda fits the picture.', '2006-12-06 13:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093060, 433553, 50695, '<td valign="top">the only thing I don''t like is the strange optical illusion that the net is sitting right on top of the ball. 6</td>', 'the only thing I don''t like is the strange optical illusion that the net is sitting right on top of the ball. 6', '2006-12-06 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093061, 431919, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely processing on this.</td>', 'Lovely processing on this.', '2006-12-06 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093062, 429142, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful sillhouettes. 7</td>', 'beautiful sillhouettes. 7', '2006-12-06 13:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093063, 430638, 50695, '<td valign="top">terrific composition. 7</td>', 'terrific composition. 7', '2006-12-06 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093065, 432119, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like wide-open-space pictures like this.  Nice soft tones, good contrast in color between the prarie and the mountains.</td>', 'I do like wide-open-space pictures like this.  Nice soft tones, good contrast in color between the prarie and the mountains.', '2006-12-06 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
