(3093226, 433205, 19961, '<td valign="top">Nicely done picture.  I didn''t quite buy the jewelery on her forehead, it seems out of place.  Perhaps I''m a little jaded from seeing too many of these "eyes" pictures?  Well done anyway and good luck!</td>', 'Nicely done picture.  I didn''t quite buy the jewelery on her forehead, it seems out of place.  Perhaps I''m a little jaded from seeing too many of these "eyes" pictures?  Well done anyway and good luck!', '2006-12-06 14:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
