(3093242, 432925, 19961, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling there should be more of it :)<br/> <br/>I think perhaps filling the picture with more of the title could have improved things. <br/> <br/>I love the light and the subtle colours though. Very well done.</td>', 'I get the feeling there should be more of it :) I think perhaps filling the picture with more of the title could have improved things.  I love the light and the subtle colours though. Very well done.', '2006-12-06 14:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
