(3096527, 428072, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice study - quite intriguing.  B&amp;W suits this well.</td>', 'Nice study - quite intriguing.  B&W suits this well.', '2006-12-07 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096532, 433122, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of the fox - very nice background and treatment of it.</td>', 'Nice portrait of the fox - very nice background and treatment of it.', '2006-12-07 13:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096535, 431768, 30982, '<td valign="top">The eyes are gorgeous!  If it were me (and it isn''t), I''d leave the focus just a bit more on the mouth and fade below that.  I do love what it does with her curly hair, though.</td>', 'The eyes are gorgeous!  If it were me (and it isn''t), I''d leave the focus just a bit more on the mouth and fade below that.  I do love what it does with her curly hair, though.', '2006-12-07 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096538, 433368, 30982, '<td valign="top">That does indeed look quite cold!  Your choice of color tones enhances the chilliness.</td>', 'That does indeed look quite cold!  Your choice of color tones enhances the chilliness.', '2006-12-07 13:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096541, 426002, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous location!  I like the softness of the water - nice color as well.</td>', 'What a gorgeous location!  I like the softness of the water - nice color as well.', '2006-12-07 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096546, 426661, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice cat portrait!  I do like the way the light is hitting the face and the way you maintained the eye on the shadow side.</td>', 'Nice cat portrait!  I do like the way the light is hitting the face and the way you maintained the eye on the shadow side.', '2006-12-07 13:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096550, 429854, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very striking contrast - quite a lovely picture.</td>', 'Very striking contrast - quite a lovely picture.', '2006-12-07 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096554, 432480, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the distorted reflection and the glow from the backlighting.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the distorted reflection and the glow from the backlighting.  Nicely done.', '2006-12-07 13:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096555, 427061, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Full of life and joy.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Full of life and joy.', '2006-12-07 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096557, 433485, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very crisp - pleasing composition and cooperative sky, too!</td>', 'Very crisp - pleasing composition and cooperative sky, too!', '2006-12-07 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096563, 433098, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great title, great eye to see this.</td>', 'Great title, great eye to see this.', '2006-12-07 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096571, 433052, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression you captured!  Nice simple background, pretty good light - maybe just a touch bright but this monitor is sensitive on the high end.  One thing you could do to improve this just a bit is use the clone tool or healing tool to take the reflection off of her lip.  Then print it, frame it, and hang it on your wall!</td>', 'Wonderful expression you captured!  Nice simple background, pretty good light - maybe just a touch bright but this monitor is sensitive on the high end.  One thing you could do to improve this just a bit is use the clone tool or healing tool to take the reflection off of her lip.  Then print it, frame it, and hang it on your wall!', '2006-12-07 13:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096573, 431256, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for shots like this - simple, yet captivating - the color in the background and the light coming from the side like it is really make this a nice study.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for shots like this - simple, yet captivating - the color in the background and the light coming from the side like it is really make this a nice study.', '2006-12-07 13:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096580, 431890, 69387, '<td valign="top">I find it beautiful that the trunks of the trees on the right look a bit different from the ones on the left. I love the overall hue.</td>', 'I find it beautiful that the trunks of the trees on the right look a bit different from the ones on the left. I love the overall hue.', '2006-12-07 13:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096585, 432202, 69387, '<td valign="top">I loved the darkness of the skies. I wish the shot was a bit closer. Great photo!</td>', 'I loved the darkness of the skies. I wish the shot was a bit closer. Great photo!', '2006-12-07 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096590, 433213, 69387, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo! Very crisp, even with lower light.</td>', 'Incredible photo! Very crisp, even with lower light.', '2006-12-07 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096595, 432866, 69387, '<td valign="top">Fiery photo beautifully captured!</td>', 'Fiery photo beautifully captured!', '2006-12-07 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096600, 433270, 69387, '<td valign="top">very nice detail! Great photo!</td>', 'very nice detail! Great photo!', '2006-12-07 13:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096605, 426860, 69387, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo, I love the serenity in this shot.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo, I love the serenity in this shot.', '2006-12-07 13:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096610, 429607, 69387, '<td valign="top">Mystical and magical, beautiful!</td>', 'Mystical and magical, beautiful!', '2006-12-07 13:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096614, 429218, 69387, '<td valign="top">Eerie and extraordinary! One of my favorites in this challenge!</td>', 'Eerie and extraordinary! One of my favorites in this challenge!', '2006-12-07 13:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096626, 433411, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo given the title - to me it looks kinda empty, with the one human walking away.  Like either the spirit of Christmas hasn''t quite got there yet, but the place is all ready and just waiting for it to arrive.</td>', 'An interesting photo given the title - to me it looks kinda empty, with the one human walking away.  Like either the spirit of Christmas hasn''t quite got there yet, but the place is all ready and just waiting for it to arrive.', '2006-12-07 13:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096630, 428672, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely study of light, color, shape and texture.  I like this.</td>', 'A lovely study of light, color, shape and texture.  I like this.', '2006-12-07 13:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096634, 433052, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very sweet image. The dark background suits the pink perfectly (and the little girl''s perfect).</td>', 'Very sweet image. The dark background suits the pink perfectly (and the little girl''s perfect).', '2006-12-07 13:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096642, 431651, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Vrey nicely done - I like that he''s looking off to the side and away, almost apprehensive.  The two women walking away in the distance - they probably walked right past him and didn''t pause or look.  Light is excellent; B&amp;W suits it well.</td>', 'Love it.  Vrey nicely done - I like that he''s looking off to the side and away, almost apprehensive.  The two women walking away in the distance - they probably walked right past him and didn''t pause or look.  Light is excellent; B&W suits it well.', '2006-12-07 13:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096644, 433442, 30982, '<td valign="top">The casual pose and sideways glance says it all to me - all in and gonna let it play out!</td>', 'The casual pose and sideways glance says it all to me - all in and gonna let it play out!', '2006-12-07 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
