(3097834, 432960, 63267, '<td valign="top">Bryce canyon is a very beautiful place.  You have captured some of that beauty here, but I am sorry to say that your image leaves me wanting more.  This is different from all of the other Bryce photos I have seen, but I can''t say that it speaks to me because of that.  Beautiful lighting, color and focus though and that is why it is still a very nice photo.  Just not one that I would keep around.</td>', 'Bryce canyon is a very beautiful place.  You have captured some of that beauty here, but I am sorry to say that your image leaves me wanting more.  This is different from all of the other Bryce photos I have seen, but I can''t say that it speaks to me because of that.  Beautiful lighting, color and focus though and that is why it is still a very nice photo.  Just not one that I would keep around.', '2006-12-07 19:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097842, 429095, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the theme of this, but there are somethings I don''t like.  Very good use of a sillhouette.  However with that use I would expect a better looking sky and a sun that doesn''t look so blown out.  The color in sthe sky is great, but it reminds me of a cheap television with poor reception.</td>', 'I like the theme of this, but there are somethings I don''t like.  Very good use of a sillhouette.  However with that use I would expect a better looking sky and a sun that doesn''t look so blown out.  The color in sthe sky is great, but it reminds me of a cheap television with poor reception.', '2006-12-07 19:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
