(3098550, 431973, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, MAN!  I was going thru some thumbnails for this challenge to do a little commenting.  This JUMPED out at me from the thumbnail.  I''m sure you''ve heard 30 times by now that this is too small, etc...  Really a shame.  :(  I do hope you''ll post it in a larger size after the challenge to share, perhaps in a forum thread or something?  Take care.</td>', 'Ahhh, MAN!  I was going thru some thumbnails for this challenge to do a little commenting.  This JUMPED out at me from the thumbnail.  I''m sure you''ve heard 30 times by now that this is too small, etc...  Really a shame.  :(  I do hope you''ll post it in a larger size after the challenge to share, perhaps in a forum thread or something?  Take care.', '2006-12-07 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098553, 432523, 30049, '<td valign="top">VERY well seen and captured.  A stunning photo!  I really enjoy the perspective on this as you made a great choice to show as much water/reflection as you have.  B/W suits this quite well also.  Have I mentioned yet that I like this?  :D  Take care.</td>', 'VERY well seen and captured.  A stunning photo!  I really enjoy the perspective on this as you made a great choice to show as much water/reflection as you have.  B/W suits this quite well also.  Have I mentioned yet that I like this?  :D  Take care.', '2006-12-07 23:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098556, 431161, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  :D  You''ve got WAY too much pink on your hands!  Hope this did ok for you.  Take care.</td>', 'Cute.  :D  You''ve got WAY too much pink on your hands!  Hope this did ok for you.  Take care.', '2006-12-07 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
