(3098563, 431180, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful place to visit isn''t it?  Hard to know where to start when you get there.  I like the POV you''ve taken this from, even the open area in the distance with the natural lighting works quite well.  Probably a bit busy for many voters (not "simple" enough), but I like it.  Hope it did ok for you.  Take care.</td>', 'Wonderful place to visit isn''t it?  Hard to know where to start when you get there.  I like the POV you''ve taken this from, even the open area in the distance with the natural lighting works quite well.  Probably a bit busy for many voters (not "simple" enough), but I like it.  Hope it did ok for you.  Take care.', '2006-12-07 23:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
