(3098569, 433213, 63267, '<td valign="top">Wow, perfect timing!  Well done!!!</td>', 'Wow, perfect timing!  Well done!!!', '2006-12-07 23:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098570, 423940, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.  Great job on the lighting, and I like the material you''ve used as a base for the subject material.  Although, I suspect that''s probably one of the most commented items for you concerning this photo?  :D  Very nice fade to black in the background.  Well done.  Hope this did alright for you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice still life.  Great job on the lighting, and I like the material you''ve used as a base for the subject material.  Although, I suspect that''s probably one of the most commented items for you concerning this photo?  :D  Very nice fade to black in the background.  Well done.  Hope this did alright for you in the challenge.', '2006-12-07 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098571, 433311, 29011, '<td valign="top">Excellent! :) 10<br/>Very adorable and what a great expression. Great lighting and setup.<br/>edit: I keep coming back to this one, the smile just does it :D<br/>Ribbon baby, ribbon. Top10 for sure or I''ll be heartbroken hehe.</td>', 'Excellent! :) 10Very adorable and what a great expression. Great lighting and setup.edit: I keep coming back to this one, the smile just does it :DRibbon baby, ribbon. Top10 for sure or I''ll be heartbroken hehe.', '2006-12-07 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098574, 433122, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. The warm colors and exposure is excellent. Is this one stuffed though? not that it matters really. 8</td>', 'Very nicely captured. The warm colors and exposure is excellent. Is this one stuffed though? not that it matters really. 8', '2006-12-07 23:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098581, 433550, 29011, '<td valign="top">Charming indeed. Great job with the lighting and composition, the choice of tone is also fine. Only nitpick is the white areas on her right cheek and hand. Could be just a tad softer and not so bright.</td>', 'Charming indeed. Great job with the lighting and composition, the choice of tone is also fine. Only nitpick is the white areas on her right cheek and hand. Could be just a tad softer and not so bright.', '2006-12-07 23:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098582, 423136, 30049, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  I''m in awe (and a bit jealous I have to admit).  Great timing on the lighting for this.  It''s funny how those reflections work when the angle and height of the camera can really alter what''s reflected (i.e. - the height of the tree in the bottom right reflection appears taller than the background mountain, but not the "right side-up" part of it).  I also like how you''ve maintained the deep blue in both the top and bottom sections of this image.  Anyway, well done and congratulations in advance on what should be a fine score.  :D</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  I''m in awe (and a bit jealous I have to admit).  Great timing on the lighting for this.  It''s funny how those reflections work when the angle and height of the camera can really alter what''s reflected (i.e. - the height of the tree in the bottom right reflection appears taller than the background mountain, but not the "right side-up" part of it).  I also like how you''ve maintained the deep blue in both the top and bottom sections of this image.  Anyway, well done and congratulations in advance on what should be a fine score.  :D', '2006-12-07 23:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098586, 433495, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. Just love the contrast here. Perfect posing. And you lit up this charming face really well, you gotta love those eyes. If I would just do one more edit, I would be darken the nose a bit.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. Just love the contrast here. Perfect posing. And you lit up this charming face really well, you gotta love those eyes. If I would just do one more edit, I would be darken the nose a bit.', '2006-12-07 23:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098588, 433450, 29011, '<td valign="top">Most excellent use of selective desaturation. It really works well here.</td>', 'Most excellent use of selective desaturation. It really works well here.', '2006-12-07 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098590, 423940, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great still life, and certainly seasonal!</td>', 'Great still life, and certainly seasonal!', '2006-12-07 23:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
