(3098911, 433305, 36619, '<td valign="top">gave it an 8, reminds me of a painting, has a dreamy quality to it too. beautiful!</td>', 'gave it an 8, reminds me of a painting, has a dreamy quality to it too. beautiful!', '2006-12-08 02:15:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098912, 433363, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this one, and the repetitive sweeping curved lines.....<br/>I also love the dramatic use of black &amp; white, to give it its punch.....</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this one, and the repetitive sweeping curved lines.....I also love the dramatic use of black & white, to give it its punch.....', '2006-12-08 02:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098915, 430404, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Isn''t it amazing how the light makes or breaks a picture.  You timed this one just right.  And darned nice score, as well.  In any ''normal'' contest, you would be far closer to the front page!</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Isn''t it amazing how the light makes or breaks a picture.  You timed this one just right.  And darned nice score, as well.  In any ''normal'' contest, you would be far closer to the front page!', '2006-12-08 02:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
