(3098919, 433213, 16230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Owen! A super capture and a well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations Owen! A super capture and a well deserved ribbon.', '2006-12-08 02:20:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098920, 432683, 14476, '<td valign="top">On this splendid image, I can only say:  "WOW!"<br/>Keep up the very good work!</td>', 'On this splendid image, I can only say:  "WOW!"Keep up the very good work!', '2006-12-08 02:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098923, 432978, 20168, '<td valign="top">Congrats Zoomy on a great shot and finish!</td>', 'Congrats Zoomy on a great shot and finish!', '2006-12-08 02:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098925, 433213, 48228, '<td valign="top">So, so worth the "Blue" ribbon, with this spectular shot. <br/> <br/>Not only your first blue, but your best score to date. <br/> <br/>I truely congratulate you on this fine image, that you can be very proud of, as I know we all are.....</td>', 'So, so worth the "Blue" ribbon, with this spectular shot.  Not only your first blue, but your best score to date.  I truely congratulate you on this fine image, that you can be very proud of, as I know we all are.....', '2006-12-08 02:22:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098926, 431919, 48228, '<td valign="top">Definately one of my favorites in this challenge, and I am so pleased it did so well for you.....</td>', 'Definately one of my favorites in this challenge, and I am so pleased it did so well for you.....', '2006-12-08 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098927, 422770, 53964, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. There is so much to look at here but it doesn''t distract from the face. You''ve managed, through lighting,focus, and processing to keep it strongly the focal point. His expression is wonderful, too.<br/>I''m surprised it didn''t score higher, and possibly one big reason is your sizing. We always like to see the largest possible size, to see all that great detail. <br/>Nice work... I find this a very compelling image :)</td>', 'I really like this image. There is so much to look at here but it doesn''t distract from the face. You''ve managed, through lighting,focus, and processing to keep it strongly the focal point. His expression is wonderful, too.I''m surprised it didn''t score higher, and possibly one big reason is your sizing. We always like to see the largest possible size, to see all that great detail. Nice work... I find this a very compelling image :)', '2006-12-08 02:24:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098928, 433427, 29658, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your red. Great pic, as always.</td>', 'Congrats on your red. Great pic, as always.', '2006-12-08 02:25:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098930, 433387, 14476, '<td valign="top">Caleb, my first impression was "Daym, you''re good."  My second might have been a little more polite, but would have said the same thing.  YOu tell a fabulous story.  Keep ''em coming.</td>', 'Caleb, my first impression was "Daym, you''re good."  My second might have been a little more polite, but would have said the same thing.  YOu tell a fabulous story.  Keep ''em coming.', '2006-12-08 02:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098931, 432527, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really loved this one, and I am just so pleased it has done sop well for you..... I only wish I had this result for my first challenge.....</td>', 'I really loved this one, and I am just so pleased it has done sop well for you..... I only wish I had this result for my first challenge.....', '2006-12-08 02:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098933, 428701, 27133, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot...job well done...once again.</td>', 'Fantastic shot...job well done...once again.', '2006-12-08 02:26:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098935, 425030, 16230, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image Laura. Congratulations on the high placing. It''s tough to come that close without winning a ribbon, but 4th out of 500+ entries ain''t bad at all.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image Laura. Congratulations on the high placing. It''s tough to come that close without winning a ribbon, but 4th out of 500+ entries ain''t bad at all.', '2006-12-08 02:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
