(3098965, 427248, 14476, '<td valign="top">Tate, sometimes we just have to shoot to suit ourselves.  This is a fine image and is worthy of space in a gallery.  Maybe the garbage can did you in?  Who''s to know.  Who cares!  I love the compostion and wish you well with all that snow ...  with more to come.</td>', 'Tate, sometimes we just have to shoot to suit ourselves.  This is a fine image and is worthy of space in a gallery.  Maybe the garbage can did you in?  Who''s to know.  Who cares!  I love the compostion and wish you well with all that snow ...  with more to come.', '2006-12-08 02:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098966, 426217, 48228, '<td valign="top">An amazing image here, that will live on forever and ever, as time goes on..... <br/>You should be so proud, not only of this image, but also for all the wonderful comments that you have received. <br/> <br/>36 comments up to this point, and this will continue to grow continually, for that I am sure.</td>', 'An amazing image here, that will live on forever and ever, as time goes on..... You should be so proud, not only of this image, but also for all the wonderful comments that you have received.  36 comments up to this point, and this will continue to grow continually, for that I am sure.', '2006-12-08 02:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098969, 432902, 38127, '<td valign="top">Dude!!! Congrats on the finish.. Stunning capture.. perfect.  <br/>I check your website often.. You are living my dream... :)</td>', 'Dude!!! Congrats on the finish.. Stunning capture.. perfect.  I check your website often.. You are living my dream... :)', '2006-12-08 02:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
