(3098985, 433540, 30214, '<td valign="top">very nice shot!</td>', 'very nice shot!', '2006-12-08 02:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3098989, 432523, 48228, '<td valign="top">Again, this is so underrated, but yet, there were some excellent images in this challenge. I love this strong black and white image, so very much. I wonder if it would have done better as a landscape format, re cropping, to take away some of the darkness of the bottom. It doesn''t bother me as I love square crops and love this image just the way it is.</td>', 'Again, this is so underrated, but yet, there were some excellent images in this challenge. I love this strong black and white image, so very much. I wonder if it would have done better as a landscape format, re cropping, to take away some of the darkness of the bottom. It doesn''t bother me as I love square crops and love this image just the way it is.', '2006-12-08 02:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
