(3099243, 432322, 40819, '<td valign="top">To score this high in a Free Study with a nude is an honor. Thank you all for your comments and votes. Mia will be so happy too.</td>', 'To score this high in a Free Study with a nude is an honor. Thank you all for your comments and votes. Mia will be so happy too.', '2006-12-08 07:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099247, 426653, 57882, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by shamer:</b></div><hr/><i> I really thought this would do much better (I had given this one a 9...), but the competition was extremely tough as well.  A powerful image in its own right no matter how it placed in this challenge! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought it might as well, but more importantly I had fun taking it.  It probably is a shot that needs more attention to appreciate, as opposed to the few seconds (if that) it might get in a challenge with 500+ entries.  Thanks for the sentiment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 07:22:35.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by shamer: I really thought this would do much better (I had given this one a 9...), but the competition was extremely tough as well.  A powerful image in its own right no matter how it placed in this challenge!   I thought it might as well, but more importantly I had fun taking it.  It probably is a shot that needs more attention to appreciate, as opposed to the few seconds (if that) it might get in a challenge with 500+ entries.  Thanks for the sentiment.', '2006-12-08 07:22:08.000000', '2006-12-08 07:22:35.000000', 0),
(3099250, 426695, 61191, '<td valign="top">Too bad this didn''t score higher! It''s a quite cool shot with an interesting atmosphere. Your lighting is very interesting, not the casual style you see every day. I don''t think the shadows are unflattering - they add depth to the photo. I like your facial expression: On the one hand you look relaxed and happy. On the other hand you look as if you were up to something (I hope I used the right phrase here...). When I saw this during voting I thought this would be your new personal best.</td>', 'Too bad this didn''t score higher! It''s a quite cool shot with an interesting atmosphere. Your lighting is very interesting, not the casual style you see every day. I don''t think the shadows are unflattering - they add depth to the photo. I like your facial expression: On the one hand you look relaxed and happy. On the other hand you look as if you were up to something (I hope I used the right phrase here...). When I saw this during voting I thought this would be your new personal best.', '2006-12-08 07:23:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099253, 433427, 57882, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, magnificantly captured.  I wish I had scenery like this near me.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, magnificantly captured.  I wish I had scenery like this near me.', '2006-12-08 07:25:41.000000', NULL, 0),
