(3099322, 433213, 38032, '<td valign="top">This photo speaks to me ... and many others I presume.  Capturing life in nature in such a way definitely helps humans appreciate a world of which we can only be envious and appreciate with our eyes -and in your case, camera.</td>', 'This photo speaks to me ... and many others I presume.  Capturing life in nature in such a way definitely helps humans appreciate a world of which we can only be envious and appreciate with our eyes -and in your case, camera.', '2006-12-08 08:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099327, 433252, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great work, Tiberius.  Foarte minunat.  Do you think the woman and boy would like a copy of this, or is it too bleak?  This shot is certainly worthy of greater display than it will garner on DPC.</td>', 'Great work, Tiberius.  Foarte minunat.  Do you think the woman and boy would like a copy of this, or is it too bleak?  This shot is certainly worthy of greater display than it will garner on DPC.', '2006-12-08 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
