(3099329, 431161, 14620, '<td valign="top">Too Freakin'' Funny!!  I would love to see the look on his face when he opens that present.  Hey, btw, did you paint the bathroom special for this? :)</td>', 'Too Freakin'' Funny!!  I would love to see the look on his face when he opens that present.  Hey, btw, did you paint the bathroom special for this? :)', '2006-12-08 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
