(3099361, 433562, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot and I''m surprised that it didn''t do a little better. I think that if you used selective desaturation and made everything B&amp;W except the umbrella, this would be really cool.  Just my own stupid opinion.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot and I''m surprised that it didn''t do a little better. I think that if you used selective desaturation and made everything B&W except the umbrella, this would be really cool.  Just my own stupid opinion.', '2006-12-08 08:50:40.000000', NULL, 0),
