(3099383, 429350, 56797, '<td valign="top">saw your post in a thread about your editing looking dark and muddy on other monitors. I have to agree it is a bit dark and muddy on mine. I still enjoy the shot though. nice work.</td>', 'saw your post in a thread about your editing looking dark and muddy on other monitors. I have to agree it is a bit dark and muddy on mine. I still enjoy the shot though. nice work.', '2006-12-08 08:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
