(3099407, 421419, 55749, '<td valign="top">Yes its the William Preston Lane Bridge otherwise known as the Chesapeake Bay Bridge, and yes its in Maryland.  The water was as common as I''ve ever seen it, by mid-day there is usually a 2 to 4 foot chop to this part of the bay.  It was a gray low contrast morning, but luckily there was just enough breakup in the clouds to allow for this gorgeous sunrise shot of the Bay Bridge.</td>', 'Yes its the William Preston Lane Bridge otherwise known as the Chesapeake Bay Bridge, and yes its in Maryland.  The water was as common as I''ve ever seen it, by mid-day there is usually a 2 to 4 foot chop to this part of the bay.  It was a gray low contrast morning, but luckily there was just enough breakup in the clouds to allow for this gorgeous sunrise shot of the Bay Bridge.', '2006-12-08 09:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099409, 433199, 60165, '<td valign="top">Hi Mark,<br/> <br/>You now own the 70-200 F/4L IS ... in a few days I will join you with a 4.1 rated shot :-(<br/> <br/>This is not the lens'' fault, but mine, because there is nothing wrong with the one I have. Then, I have no other L glass and not much SLR experience to hold it up against.<br/> <br/>In any case, this picture went to my favorites list :-) Now it is going to be hard to own this glass, after you entered this shot!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi Mark, You now own the 70-200 F/4L IS ... in a few days I will join you with a 4.1 rated shot :-( This is not the lens'' fault, but mine, because there is nothing wrong with the one I have. Then, I have no other L glass and not much SLR experience to hold it up against. In any case, this picture went to my favorites list :-) Now it is going to be hard to own this glass, after you entered this shot! ', '2006-12-08 09:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099410, 426217, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of the model.   As you say, she fits to the tee.  The cloth pattern, cigarette, and general demeanor.  Not often one gets to work with such overt character - like a time warp.  The human form can be strangely expressive, sometimes.</td>', 'Perfect capture of the model.   As you say, she fits to the tee.  The cloth pattern, cigarette, and general demeanor.  Not often one gets to work with such overt character - like a time warp.  The human form can be strangely expressive, sometimes.', '2006-12-08 09:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099412, 432678, 51538, '<td valign="top">As Qart said below, you selected a very pleasant editing process.  The model is really very lovely and classic (which is why I think the lip ring - is it? - is a jarring element in her presentation, though not the photographer''s fault).  Nice work and I look forward to seeing some more with this classic feeling of beauty.<br/>(Edited for spelling and clarity)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 10:03:17.</i></td>', 'As Qart said below, you selected a very pleasant editing process.  The model is really very lovely and classic (which is why I think the lip ring - is it? - is a jarring element in her presentation, though not the photographer''s fault).  Nice work and I look forward to seeing some more with this classic feeling of beauty.(Edited for spelling and clarity)', '2006-12-08 09:12:11.000000', '2006-12-08 10:03:17.000000', 0),
(3099413, 426217, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-12-08 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099415, 426217, 49652, '<td valign="top">Certainly should have scored higher.  This is really a magnificent candid and portrait.  I bet she would love to have a copy of this.</td>', 'Certainly should have scored higher.  This is really a magnificent candid and portrait.  I bet she would love to have a copy of this.', '2006-12-08 09:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099416, 433213, 64929, '<td valign="top">The wing spread and spread feathers, so crisp, made this shot a winner for me.  Bravo &amp; Congrats!</td>', 'The wing spread and spread feathers, so crisp, made this shot a winner for me.  Bravo & Congrats!', '2006-12-08 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099417, 430404, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice with your notes and story.  I wonder what was mined?  Copper?  Hard rock mining is a special profession.  Once involved, one never forgets.</td>', 'Nice with your notes and story.  I wonder what was mined?  Copper?  Hard rock mining is a special profession.  Once involved, one never forgets.', '2006-12-08 09:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099420, 433489, 67152, '<td valign="top">You sure can take some nice pictures of that lighthouse.  Good work again Steve.  I really like the use of Blue as the color theme - it really makes you feel the coldness of the weather.</td>', 'You sure can take some nice pictures of that lighthouse.  Good work again Steve.  I really like the use of Blue as the color theme - it really makes you feel the coldness of the weather.', '2006-12-08 09:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099421, 429603, 51538, '<td valign="top">You got an 8 from me.  I love the sparse, open space.  Wild nature at its best - presented in a completely uncompromising way.  I like the way Falc, one of the commenters, presents nature, softened down with boulders and trees of interest in the foreground.  But that''s not the way it happens in real life - or at least only sometimes.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'You got an 8 from me.  I love the sparse, open space.  Wild nature at its best - presented in a completely uncompromising way.  I like the way Falc, one of the commenters, presents nature, softened down with boulders and trees of interest in the foreground.  But that''s not the way it happens in real life - or at least only sometimes.  Keep up the good work.', '2006-12-08 09:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099427, 432984, 51538, '<td valign="top">I gave a 6 but came back out of curiosity to find out more.  The image had a dark feeling to it which sort of repelled me at the time.  The large blank space on the left didn''t seem to contribute much.  The ceiling does contribute a lot, though.  On returning, I can see past my initial feelings of rejection.  It''s an image - like blue cheese - that is an acquired taste, if you know what I mean.</td>', 'I gave a 6 but came back out of curiosity to find out more.  The image had a dark feeling to it which sort of repelled me at the time.  The large blank space on the left didn''t seem to contribute much.  The ceiling does contribute a lot, though.  On returning, I can see past my initial feelings of rejection.  It''s an image - like blue cheese - that is an acquired taste, if you know what I mean.', '2006-12-08 09:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099428, 424855, 51538, '<td valign="top">You got an 8 from me and I certainly like the photo a lot.  Would be proud to have this in my portfolio.</td>', 'You got an 8 from me and I certainly like the photo a lot.  Would be proud to have this in my portfolio.', '2006-12-08 09:21:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099430, 433305, 62095, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot.', '2006-12-08 09:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099434, 433305, 50695, '<td valign="top">You scored suspiciously high on this shot. I might have to drop a note to the SC... btw, art is all about happy accidents. congratulations.</td>', 'You scored suspiciously high on this shot. I might have to drop a note to the SC... btw, art is all about happy accidents. congratulations.', '2006-12-08 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099436, 433404, 51538, '<td valign="top">I got this feeling that this was Joey''s.  But there are so many imitators these days that it''s hard to tell for sure.  It''s one of those types of images that is an acquired taste - like anchovies or blue cheese - but once it does there is a place in the pantry for it.  How are the edges of that lens on the 5D.  I''m thinking of changing body to the 5D but in doing so I will bankrupt myself and will not be able to buy another lens for ten years ;-)  Is it muddy on the corners?</td>', 'I got this feeling that this was Joey''s.  But there are so many imitators these days that it''s hard to tell for sure.  It''s one of those types of images that is an acquired taste - like anchovies or blue cheese - but once it does there is a place in the pantry for it.  How are the edges of that lens on the 5D.  I''m thinking of changing body to the 5D but in doing so I will bankrupt myself and will not be able to buy another lens for ten years ;-)  Is it muddy on the corners?', '2006-12-08 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099440, 433015, 51538, '<td valign="top">Tumulus is a word I associate with Britain and I was wondering who this photo might belong to and where it was taken.  It''s hard to appreciate the delicate subtlety of this lovely image in the context of a challenge.  I like the high placement in the frame of the horizon.  Glad to see some more of your work too.  It is inspiring.  Season''s Greetings to you.</td>', 'Tumulus is a word I associate with Britain and I was wondering who this photo might belong to and where it was taken.  It''s hard to appreciate the delicate subtlety of this lovely image in the context of a challenge.  I like the high placement in the frame of the horizon.  Glad to see some more of your work too.  It is inspiring.  Season''s Greetings to you.', '2006-12-08 09:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099442, 424557, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely light/shadows across the child''s face.  Nice clarity and well executed photo.</td>', 'Lovely light/shadows across the child''s face.  Nice clarity and well executed photo.', '2006-12-08 09:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099443, 422758, 48968, '<td valign="top">Should have placed higher, in my humble opinion. I love this shot.</td>', 'Should have placed higher, in my humble opinion. I love this shot.', '2006-12-08 09:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099446, 433220, 51538, '<td valign="top">This was and is a heck of a jolt and a shot too.  Nice work.  Not sure why, I usually find your style appealing.  I failed to comment at the time but voted a 7.  Keep up this inspiring work.  Getting comments feels better almost than votes, right!</td>', 'This was and is a heck of a jolt and a shot too.  Nice work.  Not sure why, I usually find your style appealing.  I failed to comment at the time but voted a 7.  Keep up this inspiring work.  Getting comments feels better almost than votes, right!', '2006-12-08 09:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099448, 433017, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like this on the voting round and came back to find out more.  I expect it would look pleasant in b/w too.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like this on the voting round and came back to find out more.  I expect it would look pleasant in b/w too.', '2006-12-08 09:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099464, 431631, 56254, '<td valign="top">I''m blown away that this didn''t score higher ... I gave it a 10 ... absolutely LOVE this image ...</td>', 'I''m blown away that this didn''t score higher ... I gave it a 10 ... absolutely LOVE this image ...', '2006-12-08 09:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099468, 430963, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty model for some nice portrait work.  Hope to see more.  You got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty model for some nice portrait work.  Hope to see more.  You got a 7 from me.', '2006-12-08 09:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099469, 429487, 51538, '<td valign="top">I thought this portrait to be very pleasant.  The subject is hardly pretty - but the overall presentation works very well.</td>', 'I thought this portrait to be very pleasant.  The subject is hardly pretty - but the overall presentation works very well.', '2006-12-08 09:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099472, 433213, 66223, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot with unbelievable timing!  Really shows that with patience you do not need a super expensive 500 mm lens for bird shots.</td>', 'Amazing shot with unbelievable timing!  Really shows that with patience you do not need a super expensive 500 mm lens for bird shots.', '2006-12-08 09:48:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099476, 430638, 66384, '<td valign="top">These birds are lovely and the pose is touching. The light is good. I gave it a 6, and I am trying to understand why it is lacking in impact. I think it is the green background. The peahen''s colors are so soft that I think the green overpowers her. Also her topknot is not standing out well against the green. Really nice shot though.</td>', 'These birds are lovely and the pose is touching. The light is good. I gave it a 6, and I am trying to understand why it is lacking in impact. I think it is the green background. The peahen''s colors are so soft that I think the green overpowers her. Also her topknot is not standing out well against the green. Really nice shot though.', '2006-12-08 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099479, 433017, 35545, '<td valign="top">Really nice informal portrait.  Good detail and skin tones.</td>', 'Really nice informal portrait.  Good detail and skin tones.', '2006-12-08 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099481, 433551, 51538, '<td valign="top">Totally perverse.  I need treatment.  I gave this a 9 in the challenge.  It reminds me of the moment before the riot.</td>', 'Totally perverse.  I need treatment.  I gave this a 9 in the challenge.  It reminds me of the moment before the riot.', '2006-12-08 09:53:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099482, 433562, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think the only reason this didn''t score higher was the crop, which is unfortunate because the crop adds so much energy to the picture. Can''t you just feel the electricity created by the subject touching or almost touching the edge of the frame? Some people are made uncomfortable by energy.</td>', 'I think the only reason this didn''t score higher was the crop, which is unfortunate because the crop adds so much energy to the picture. Can''t you just feel the electricity created by the subject touching or almost touching the edge of the frame? Some people are made uncomfortable by energy.', '2006-12-08 09:53:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099483, 432678, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m truly amazed at the lack of attentnion this got.  Just stellar.</td>', 'I''m truly amazed at the lack of attentnion this got.  Just stellar.', '2006-12-08 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099485, 430404, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light.  Thank you for the notes -- they make a good picture even better.</td>', 'Beautiful light.  Thank you for the notes -- they make a good picture even better.', '2006-12-08 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099486, 429350, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good work Steve.  Now you just have to talk these ladies into giving you a  portrait session.</td>', 'Good work Steve.  Now you just have to talk these ladies into giving you a  portrait session.', '2006-12-08 09:56:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099495, 429739, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not many people manage to get the Brown Ribbon without getting a single "1".  That is an award in itself.<br/> <br/>Correction edit: not a Brown ribbon even.  Just was the last page that I scrolled down to.  Oh well, better luck next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 12:47:27.</i></td>', 'Not many people manage to get the Brown Ribbon without getting a single "1".  That is an award in itself. Correction edit: not a Brown ribbon even.  Just was the last page that I scrolled down to.  Oh well, better luck next time.', '2006-12-08 09:59:57.000000', '2006-12-08 12:47:27.000000', 0),
(3099496, 424289, 43437, '<td valign="top">i love your colors here and i think if the sky wasnt blown this would have placed much higher.</td>', 'i love your colors here and i think if the sky wasnt blown this would have placed much higher.', '2006-12-08 10:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099502, 432835, 43437, '<td valign="top">love the framing!  Colors are wonderful.  Only thing is that it feels cramped for some reason.</td>', 'love the framing!  Colors are wonderful.  Only thing is that it feels cramped for some reason.', '2006-12-08 10:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099505, 433401, 43437, '<td valign="top">it seems like the focus is just a tad behind where it needs to be here.  THe subject, beautiful fall leaves with ice is really great but the ice in the very front leaf is blurry and distracting.</td>', 'it seems like the focus is just a tad behind where it needs to be here.  THe subject, beautiful fall leaves with ice is really great but the ice in the very front leaf is blurry and distracting.', '2006-12-08 10:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099506, 433531, 50695, '<td valign="top">congratulations, you have the most underrated shot in the challenge! :)</td>', 'congratulations, you have the most underrated shot in the challenge! :)', '2006-12-08 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099509, 433305, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am stunned at the lack of artful viewers.  This is stunning on so many levels.  I see it in an avant garde gallery hanging amidst other like images.  Keep up the work, deb.  It is just outstanding.</td>', 'I am stunned at the lack of artful viewers.  This is stunning on so many levels.  I see it in an avant garde gallery hanging amidst other like images.  Keep up the work, deb.  It is just outstanding.', '2006-12-08 10:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099510, 433199, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW what a finish!!!</td>', 'WOW what a finish!!!', '2006-12-08 10:06:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099517, 432150, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8. I thought the bright simple colors and the glow were magical, and really did evoke Narnia for me.</td>', 'I gave this an 8. I thought the bright simple colors and the glow were magical, and really did evoke Narnia for me.', '2006-12-08 10:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099522, 429487, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looks like a classic, vintage sort of portrait. It''s fun to see it of a video director instead of a film director. I gave it an 8</td>', 'This looks like a classic, vintage sort of portrait. It''s fun to see it of a video director instead of a film director. I gave it an 8', '2006-12-08 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099526, 433540, 32084, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  First, you used my favorite color scheme - B&amp;Wish!  Second, the depth of the image is amazing.  Third, there is so very much to look at.  The stories that can be imagined when looking at this are infinite.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'This is awesome!  First, you used my favorite color scheme - B&Wish!  Second, the depth of the image is amazing.  Third, there is so very much to look at.  The stories that can be imagined when looking at this are infinite.  Wonderful job!', '2006-12-08 10:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099529, 433277, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot of some really cool architecture. I gave this an 8.</td>', 'beautiful shot of some really cool architecture. I gave this an 8.', '2006-12-08 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099533, 429826, 57851, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys. I was kinda sad that no one commented because I really need to know what can be done better.. you know, so I can improve as a photographer. Anyways thanks to the two of you for taking the time to comment! It means alot=)<br/> <br/>-Marella</td>', 'Thanks guys. I was kinda sad that no one commented because I really need to know what can be done better.. you know, so I can improve as a photographer. Anyways thanks to the two of you for taking the time to comment! It means alot=) -Marella', '2006-12-08 10:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099545, 431533, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this and gave it an 8. I think I would like it even better if the sky weren''t such a flat gray. That seems to flatten the entire image. Did you ever experiment with Filter&gt;Render&gt;Clouds? Take a look at what that does. And please pardon me if I have taken too much liberty with your art.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=435985" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/66384/thumb/435985.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/66384/thumb/435985.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/66384/thumb/435985.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I like this and gave it an 8. I think I would like it even better if the sky weren''t such a flat gray. That seems to flatten the entire image. Did you ever experiment with Filter>Render>Clouds? Take a look at what that does. And please pardon me if I have taken too much liberty with your art.', '2006-12-08 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099546, 433213, 69350, '<td valign="top">Astounding beauty! Congratulations!</td>', 'Astounding beauty! Congratulations!', '2006-12-08 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099554, 421496, 52549, '<td valign="top">Hey, congrats on this Mike. Unusual, interesting image and great lighting.</td>', 'Hey, congrats on this Mike. Unusual, interesting image and great lighting.', '2006-12-08 10:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099556, 422951, 42495, '<td valign="top">This was the one picture I was worried that would not place where it should have.  Great character study and you really captured the essence of  the man.  The gaze downward, wrinkles, hat, etc, make this one of the best in the challenge.  Congrats on your score and placement.</td>', 'This was the one picture I was worried that would not place where it should have.  Great character study and you really captured the essence of  the man.  The gaze downward, wrinkles, hat, etc, make this one of the best in the challenge.  Congrats on your score and placement.', '2006-12-08 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099557, 426108, 35739, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think it is perfect the way it is.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think it is perfect the way it is.', '2006-12-08 10:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099561, 433305, 57229, '<td valign="top">Well, you know it''s good, so I don''t have to tell you that, but POW! didn''t it work. I''ll join the chorus of congratulations for having the arsehole to enter it. Thanks.</td>', 'Well, you know it''s good, so I don''t have to tell you that, but POW! didn''t it work. I''ll join the chorus of congratulations for having the arsehole to enter it. Thanks.', '2006-12-08 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099567, 426217, 47205, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome capture Sandy. The feeling of this candid is amazing, and I am with everyone else, this should have scored much higher then it did...<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'This is an awesome capture Sandy. The feeling of this candid is amazing, and I am with everyone else, this should have scored much higher then it did... M', '2006-12-08 10:35:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099579, 429350, 18349, '<td valign="top">The little things in this picture really make me wonder about the backstory...the polaroid camera, the elegant shoes in his hand, the more comfy shoes on his feet (must have been a boy scout...always prepared!). Love the "Arsenal" sign in the back.  Could be social commentary, considering the subject matter.  Very well-seen and captured.  Great image, just skipped through by rushed voters.  :)</td>', 'The little things in this picture really make me wonder about the backstory...the polaroid camera, the elegant shoes in his hand, the more comfy shoes on his feet (must have been a boy scout...always prepared!). Love the "Arsenal" sign in the back.  Could be social commentary, considering the subject matter.  Very well-seen and captured.  Great image, just skipped through by rushed voters.  :)', '2006-12-08 10:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099580, 433551, 66384, '<td valign="top">This must be the shot that inspired the topic for the current challenge "For Sale".</td>', 'This must be the shot that inspired the topic for the current challenge "For Sale".', '2006-12-08 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099590, 427608, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''ve never used a gradient map. I''ll have to experiment, if this it what it can do.</td>', 'I''ve never used a gradient map. I''ll have to experiment, if this it what it can do.', '2006-12-08 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099594, 433531, 23053, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> congratulations, you have the most underrated shot in the challenge! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks...I don''t know if I agree, but everyone is fully entitled to their own views.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: congratulations, you have the most underrated shot in the challenge! :)   Thanks...I don''t know if I agree, but everyone is fully entitled to their own views.', '2006-12-08 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099596, 432678, 37961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-12-08 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099606, 433261, 66384, '<td valign="top">While I think this is a very nice composition, for some reason I''m not drawn into the shot. It may be that it is a little flat. Perhaps a touch of Image&gt;Adjustment&gt;Exposure (offset and gamma) would improve that.</td>', 'While I think this is a very nice composition, for some reason I''m not drawn into the shot. It may be that it is a little flat. Perhaps a touch of Image>Adjustment>Exposure (offset and gamma) would improve that.', '2006-12-08 10:59:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099615, 425030, 28532, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in the challenge. Congrats on the 4th place finish. It is an excellent shot!!</td>', 'This is my favorite in the challenge. Congrats on the 4th place finish. It is an excellent shot!!', '2006-12-08 11:04:03.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3099617, 426217, 37961, '<td valign="top">As you know, this sort of portraiture really appeals to me. I just got done reading the thread about this photo in the forums, and I have to say that some people do not find any thing stirring about moody photography, which is probably why I have so much trouble finding work that pays. This portrait will not appeal to many types of people because it comes off as ''just a woman with a big nose''. To those sensitive to good portraiture, you see much more than that. To find a woman like this on the street or in a restaurant and capture her with this much character is nothing short of brilliant in my opinion. The fact that she is living with this nose, without having had it surgically altered by her age is a testimony to self acceptance, and she doesn''t appear ashamed of it either. I think she is beautiful and I too, think it deserved a much higher score. Way to go Sandy.<br/> <br/></td>', 'As you know, this sort of portraiture really appeals to me. I just got done reading the thread about this photo in the forums, and I have to say that some people do not find any thing stirring about moody photography, which is probably why I have so much trouble finding work that pays. This portrait will not appeal to many types of people because it comes off as ''just a woman with a big nose''. To those sensitive to good portraiture, you see much more than that. To find a woman like this on the street or in a restaurant and capture her with this much character is nothing short of brilliant in my opinion. The fact that she is living with this nose, without having had it surgically altered by her age is a testimony to self acceptance, and she doesn''t appear ashamed of it either. I think she is beautiful and I too, think it deserved a much higher score. Way to go Sandy. ', '2006-12-08 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099623, 429350, 37961, '<td valign="top">Fabulous candid. You captured the essence of the moment. Very telling and entertaining photo.</td>', 'Fabulous candid. You captured the essence of the moment. Very telling and entertaining photo.', '2006-12-08 11:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099631, 433554, 28532, '<td valign="top">Congrats on finishing in the top ten - however, I fully expected this to be a ribbon winner.  It is such a fantastic picture! Nicely done!!</td>', 'Congrats on finishing in the top ten - however, I fully expected this to be a ribbon winner.  It is such a fantastic picture! Nicely done!!', '2006-12-08 11:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099656, 433479, 66384, '<td valign="top">You''ve done it again -- captured a great shot of that wonderful little model. The shot of him sitting on the path is still fresh in my mind, and I love the shot you call ''swagger''. <br/> <br/>The setting in this shot is perfect: the window with the broken screen, the ramp, and the shingles. So uplifting to see the joy of simple physical play in this age of electronic toys.</td>', 'You''ve done it again -- captured a great shot of that wonderful little model. The shot of him sitting on the path is still fresh in my mind, and I love the shot you call ''swagger''.  The setting in this shot is perfect: the window with the broken screen, the ramp, and the shingles. So uplifting to see the joy of simple physical play in this age of electronic toys.', '2006-12-08 11:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099663, 433479, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! Love the life that vibrates from your little boy!</td>', 'This is fantastic! Love the life that vibrates from your little boy!', '2006-12-08 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099680, 433305, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot Deb! I would hang this on my wall for sure!</td>', 'This is a stunning shot Deb! I would hang this on my wall for sure!', '2006-12-08 11:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099681, 433479, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, and I love the B&amp;W treatment.  It seems a bit dark, but that might be my monitor.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, and I love the B&W treatment.  It seems a bit dark, but that might be my monitor.', '2006-12-08 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099690, 433305, 66384, '<td valign="top">I didn''t leave a comment, just a very high score. Didn''t really know what to say except that it is spectacular.</td>', 'I didn''t leave a comment, just a very high score. Didn''t really know what to say except that it is spectacular.', '2006-12-08 11:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099692, 426217, 42567, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE Sandy!!  One of my fav''s on dpc!  Great job</td>', 'VERY NICE Sandy!!  One of my fav''s on dpc!  Great job', '2006-12-08 11:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099697, 426108, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great job Mandy!  Very nice picture</td>', 'Great job Mandy!  Very nice picture', '2006-12-08 11:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099701, 431788, 48245, '<td valign="top">Man... this was my number one pick. Should have placed higher. Great picture!</td>', 'Man... this was my number one pick. Should have placed higher. Great picture!', '2006-12-08 11:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099714, 433549, 66384, '<td valign="top">I was noticing the lack of comments, then I noticed you didn''t even comment yourself.:) The lone commenter said the color and contrast were the problem. I think it is the light. The foreground has no interesting light on it. With advanced editing, you might be able to do something about that. You have a beautiful scene and composition to work with.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 11:48:42.</i></td>', 'I was noticing the lack of comments, then I noticed you didn''t even comment yourself.:) The lone commenter said the color and contrast were the problem. I think it is the light. The foreground has no interesting light on it. With advanced editing, you might be able to do something about that. You have a beautiful scene and composition to work with.', '2006-12-08 11:46:30.000000', '2006-12-08 11:48:42.000000', 0),
(3099716, 429852, 48245, '<td valign="top">jeesh... I gave this a 7. I really liked the capture!</td>', 'jeesh... I gave this a 7. I really liked the capture!', '2006-12-08 11:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099730, 429064, 42013, '<td valign="top">You have a great talent for bringing out the fine textures and colors of any scene.</td>', 'You have a great talent for bringing out the fine textures and colors of any scene.', '2006-12-08 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099738, 433442, 48954, '<td valign="top">Out take from the black and white challenge, that''s what it is hehe</td>', 'Out take from the black and white challenge, that''s what it is hehe', '2006-12-08 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099742, 424969, 70, '<td valign="top">For me, this image just lacks connection. It has a nice background. His left shoulder area looks a bit soft. I think maybe your position is a bit too close and low. It''s nicely exposed. There''s just nothing to pull me in...I don''t know him, there''s nothing especially striking about him (except maybe the shirt ;) ) and it lacks anything that makes me want to consider it longer which is something you really need when you''re competing against 500 entries. Sweet bokeh, though.</td>', 'For me, this image just lacks connection. It has a nice background. His left shoulder area looks a bit soft. I think maybe your position is a bit too close and low. It''s nicely exposed. There''s just nothing to pull me in...I don''t know him, there''s nothing especially striking about him (except maybe the shirt ;) ) and it lacks anything that makes me want to consider it longer which is something you really need when you''re competing against 500 entries. Sweet bokeh, though.', '2006-12-08 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099747, 424969, 37961, '<td valign="top">I agree with mk pretty much, but had this guy been off centered and pulled back just a tad, it would have had more impact. The light is wonderful, the focus perfect and the colors really pop though.</td>', 'I agree with mk pretty much, but had this guy been off centered and pulled back just a tad, it would have had more impact. The light is wonderful, the focus perfect and the colors really pop though.', '2006-12-08 11:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099758, 424289, 66384, '<td valign="top">I guess that new popup message asking for comments on scores below 4 isn''t working. Six people owe you comments as to why they thought your entry sucked. I don''t agree with those ratings. I like this and agree with Kivet that the sky is probably what hurt this. But skies can be fixed with advanced editing. Unfortunately, one thing that can''t be fixed in post processing is the straight line of the shore that cuts the photo in half. Still I like the shot, especially the little picnic table.</td>', 'I guess that new popup message asking for comments on scores below 4 isn''t working. Six people owe you comments as to why they thought your entry sucked. I don''t agree with those ratings. I like this and agree with Kivet that the sky is probably what hurt this. But skies can be fixed with advanced editing. Unfortunately, one thing that can''t be fixed in post processing is the straight line of the shore that cuts the photo in half. Still I like the shot, especially the little picnic table.', '2006-12-08 12:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099773, 432835, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot and gave it a 9. I think the reason I didn''t go all the way is the narrow crop. The framing, colors, contrast, light, and path leading into the woods, all make for a really fine photograph.</td>', 'I like this a lot and gave it a 9. I think the reason I didn''t go all the way is the narrow crop. The framing, colors, contrast, light, and path leading into the woods, all make for a really fine photograph.', '2006-12-08 12:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099774, 432678, 23294, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments.<br/> <br/>Yes, it''s a lipring :-)</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments. Yes, it''s a lipring :-)', '2006-12-08 12:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099783, 433012, 29490, '<td valign="top">Cool shades!</td>', 'Cool shades!', '2006-12-08 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099789, 433401, 66384, '<td valign="top">I agree with you, I like the Fall leaves with the ice. Too bad the camera didn''t pick up any sparkling bokeh in that white background. It would have been a knockout. Maybe sun is what was called for here, for the benefit of both the leaves and the background. But you can''t control that. Nice job working with what you had.</td>', 'I agree with you, I like the Fall leaves with the ice. Too bad the camera didn''t pick up any sparkling bokeh in that white background. It would have been a knockout. Maybe sun is what was called for here, for the benefit of both the leaves and the background. But you can''t control that. Nice job working with what you had.', '2006-12-08 12:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099790, 433213, 42013, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great shot! Very powerful.</td>', 'Congrats on a great shot! Very powerful.', '2006-12-08 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099798, 433213, 60846, '<td valign="top">this is soooooooo gooooooooooooooodddddddddddddd.............!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'this is soooooooo gooooooooooooooodddddddddddddd.............!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2006-12-08 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099799, 425030, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a laugh!  why enter the same subject again?!?  i guess most of the voters didn''t realize it until it was too late ;-)<br/> <br/>i guess we should ask shannon why he uses plotter prints all the time, or ask manny why he shoots portraits of beautiful girls all the time, or larus why he shoots landscapes and women all the time...<br/> <br/>my first reaction was holy smokes, he pulled it off with the same basic shot--and nobody noticed.  well, nobody but the 8 that really took offense to it.<br/> <br/>thanks for providing some fodder for the b!+chbag ;-).  enjoy your well-deserved score.</td>', 'what a laugh!  why enter the same subject again?!?  i guess most of the voters didn''t realize it until it was too late ;-) i guess we should ask shannon why he uses plotter prints all the time, or ask manny why he shoots portraits of beautiful girls all the time, or larus why he shoots landscapes and women all the time... my first reaction was holy smokes, he pulled it off with the same basic shot--and nobody noticed.  well, nobody but the 8 that really took offense to it. thanks for providing some fodder for the b!+chbag ;-).  enjoy your well-deserved score.', '2006-12-08 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099809, 433427, 42013, '<td valign="top">"my goals for 2007 to ribbon in a free study, guess I´ll have to find a new goal now..."<br/> <br/>Just try harder in December''s FS ;). Congrats!</td>', '"my goals for 2007 to ribbon in a free study, guess I´ll have to find a new goal now..." Just try harder in December''s FS ;). Congrats!', '2006-12-08 12:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099826, 433213, 51269, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning- great job- congrats !</td>', 'Absolutely stunning- great job- congrats !', '2006-12-08 12:38:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099830, 426645, 66384, '<td valign="top">I take a lot of shots of Great Blue Herons, so I know a good one when I see it. This is a good one, but not a great one. I think that''s what hurt the score -- too many other GBH shots out there to compare it with. <br/> <br/>What I do really admire about this is the background. That is hard to get -- the colors, clarity, and depth. So often the background is blurred out to prevent it from competing with the subject. Here the subject almost competes with the background. I really like that swamp.</td>', 'I take a lot of shots of Great Blue Herons, so I know a good one when I see it. This is a good one, but not a great one. I think that''s what hurt the score -- too many other GBH shots out there to compare it with.  What I do really admire about this is the background. That is hard to get -- the colors, clarity, and depth. So often the background is blurred out to prevent it from competing with the subject. Here the subject almost competes with the background. I really like that swamp.', '2006-12-08 12:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099835, 425030, 41746, '<td valign="top">No reason to be offensive to Laura for entering the same shot. Even though we can find it astonishing I have to say that the voters respond is more surprising. If someone is to blame for the high score its must be the voters. Have to say I like the b&amp;w better. Much better.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 12:51:19.</i></td>', 'No reason to be offensive to Laura for entering the same shot. Even though we can find it astonishing I have to say that the voters respond is more surprising. If someone is to blame for the high score its must be the voters. Have to say I like the b&w better. Much better.', '2006-12-08 12:42:09.000000', '2006-12-08 12:51:19.000000', 0),
(3099841, 425030, 19708, '<td valign="top">My initial thought was similar to some regarding using the same shot again, but it isn''t the same shot, and you are right about why not use your best of the month again - it''s been done many times before, and will be done many times after this.<br/> <br/>I loved the b&amp;w and now this color verison is equally as amazing.<br/>Congrats on your high placings on both shots, as they are truly magnificent.</td>', 'My initial thought was similar to some regarding using the same shot again, but it isn''t the same shot, and you are right about why not use your best of the month again - it''s been done many times before, and will be done many times after this. I loved the b&w and now this color verison is equally as amazing.Congrats on your high placings on both shots, as they are truly magnificent.', '2006-12-08 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099847, 433213, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your blue!!!! What incredible timing and beauty in this shot!!!  Astounding and Amazing!!!</td>', 'Congrats on your blue!!!! What incredible timing and beauty in this shot!!!  Astounding and Amazing!!!', '2006-12-08 12:46:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099857, 433213, 48201, '<td valign="top">The most amazing things to me here are the perfect timing (feet not quite in the water) and great clarity.  Stunning shot.  I love the tips of the wings.</td>', 'The most amazing things to me here are the perfect timing (feet not quite in the water) and great clarity.  Stunning shot.  I love the tips of the wings.', '2006-12-08 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3099858, 433175, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love bird faces. This is a great one. That eye is beautiful. You have done a wonderful job with the color in this shot, and the highlights are perfect. You got a good score too. Congratulations!</td>', 'I love bird faces. This is a great one. That eye is beautiful. You have done a wonderful job with the color in this shot, and the highlights are perfect. You got a good score too. Congratulations!', '2006-12-08 12:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
