(3101090, 426654, 51793, '<td valign="top">I sure would like to know who gave me a 1? Must be someone that wanted to vote low for everyone else to raise their scores. These people need to be removed from the site. Not that I would have won a blue ribbon or anything but its people like them that ruin it for everyone else that submits. This picture is no where near a 1. The picture is crystal clear and you can see everything. I would like the person that voted a 1 on this picture to please tell me what in the H where you thinking and why would you vote a 1???</td>', 'I sure would like to know who gave me a 1? Must be someone that wanted to vote low for everyone else to raise their scores. These people need to be removed from the site. Not that I would have won a blue ribbon or anything but its people like them that ruin it for everyone else that submits. This picture is no where near a 1. The picture is crystal clear and you can see everything. I would like the person that voted a 1 on this picture to please tell me what in the H where you thinking and why would you vote a 1???', '2006-12-08 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 0),
