(3101364, 433495, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Your work is super fine. I have only a little suggestion which you may wish at times to consider. This involves changing the shapes of the cathlights because the round one have a more natural look. However, each image must be judged on its own merit and in truth there may be no objection at all to this image. I just heard you say earlier that you were studying portrait and I just want to offer another posibility.</td>', 'Very well done. Your work is super fine. I have only a little suggestion which you may wish at times to consider. This involves changing the shapes of the cathlights because the round one have a more natural look. However, each image must be judged on its own merit and in truth there may be no objection at all to this image. I just heard you say earlier that you were studying portrait and I just want to offer another posibility.', '2006-12-08 23:44:07.000000', NULL, 0),
