(3101761, 426860, 22301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Dude great shot! But what really makes it is no title. Love That! :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No the title is his name. He has to get in the shot some how. :P </i></td></tr></table> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.smileyhut.com/laughing/hysterical.gif'', strrpos(''//www.smileyhut.com/laughing/hysterical.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.smileyhut.com/laughing/hysterical.gif"/><b>ROFL</b>Its true because its funny :P</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Originally posted by thegrandwazoo: Dude great shot! But what really makes it is no title. Love That! :-)   No the title is his name. He has to get in the shot some how. :P  ROFLIts true because its funny :P', '2006-12-09 05:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
