(3102131, 424382, 29949, '<td valign="top">WOW! I can see moon crater nicely! Great shot!</td>', 'WOW! I can see moon crater nicely! Great shot!', '2006-12-09 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102145, 433277, 29949, '<td valign="top">interasting angle and that building(or stairs?) is artistic!<br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'interasting angle and that building(or stairs?) is artistic!Nice shot!', '2006-12-09 12:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102156, 425030, 7810, '<td valign="top">Another great take on this beautiful scene. I love the colour version.<br/>Thanks for the directions... I am going to try and get out this weekend to try my hand at shooting this lovely image. I only hope I can come close to what you have achieved here. Well done and congrats again on the high placing ... 4 out of 501 wow indeed!<br/> <br/>Go GTA Go!!!!</td>', 'Another great take on this beautiful scene. I love the colour version.Thanks for the directions... I am going to try and get out this weekend to try my hand at shooting this lovely image. I only hope I can come close to what you have achieved here. Well done and congrats again on the high placing ... 4 out of 501 wow indeed! Go GTA Go!!!!', '2006-12-09 12:16:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102204, 425030, 66348, '<td valign="top">No idea why everyone was crying about this shot, maybe because they couldn''t get a picture as nice as this one. Everything is virtually perfect in this shot, the free study IS about the best shot of the month, and this was def yours. Its odd but I think my favorite part is the fog in the distance, it adds enchantment. Nice job and keep up the good work.</td>', 'No idea why everyone was crying about this shot, maybe because they couldn''t get a picture as nice as this one. Everything is virtually perfect in this shot, the free study IS about the best shot of the month, and this was def yours. Its odd but I think my favorite part is the fog in the distance, it adds enchantment. Nice job and keep up the good work.', '2006-12-09 12:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102250, 433551, 50695, '<td valign="top">actually, there is no mirror. it''s just another photograph. and this is a rather severe crop, so I could have zoomed out. thanks for the wonderful comments!</td>', 'actually, there is no mirror. it''s just another photograph. and this is a rather severe crop, so I could have zoomed out. thanks for the wonderful comments!', '2006-12-09 13:04:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102271, 433550, 69585, '<td valign="top">fantástico.Congrats for this photo!!</td>', 'fantástico.Congrats for this photo!!', '2006-12-09 13:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102277, 425030, 15711, '<td valign="top">Awesome in color.  I''m a huge fan of BW but I must say, color certainly does this jewel justice.  Congratulations!!</td>', 'Awesome in color.  I''m a huge fan of BW but I must say, color certainly does this jewel justice.  Congratulations!!', '2006-12-09 13:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102281, 433213, 55952, '<td valign="top">Wow. just wow. my jaw dropped literally!</td>', 'Wow. just wow. my jaw dropped literally!', '2006-12-09 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102401, 433017, 64176, '<td valign="top">Well, I said I would eat his hat if this didn''t make the Top 20.  No one''s gonna hold me to that I hope. I thought this photo may have been taken in New York, you see, but here''s the thing: I just don''t have the funds to go tracking this guy down in Israel and besides, he probably likes his hat.</td>', 'Well, I said I would eat his hat if this didn''t make the Top 20.  No one''s gonna hold me to that I hope. I thought this photo may have been taken in New York, you see, but here''s the thing: I just don''t have the funds to go tracking this guy down in Israel and besides, he probably likes his hat.', '2006-12-09 14:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102431, 432702, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a delightful shot!  I now know what you were talking about with the focus, but it''s not that much off and the shot as a whole is really, well, delighful!  In fact, the slight out of focus lends to the kitten just happening to wander into the picture concept.  The colors are excellent, the whimsical nature of the hat with the red rose sitting on the vase is wonderful, and the painting on the wall really tops it all off.  AND you have three favorites!!  This, by my definition, is a successful Free Study entry.</td>', 'I thought this was a delightful shot!  I now know what you were talking about with the focus, but it''s not that much off and the shot as a whole is really, well, delighful!  In fact, the slight out of focus lends to the kitten just happening to wander into the picture concept.  The colors are excellent, the whimsical nature of the hat with the red rose sitting on the vase is wonderful, and the painting on the wall really tops it all off.  AND you have three favorites!!  This, by my definition, is a successful Free Study entry.', '2006-12-09 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102442, 430638, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d never have known you tinted the background - it looks perfectly natural to me which means you did a great job not only applying a tint, but picking the right one.  I''d never even have thought of that.  To me, it''s just a little soft - I''d normally suspect camera shake (that''s my problem) but I see you''re using an IS lens.  May have been just a bit of movement by the birds themselves.  But soft isn''t always bad - often it''s a matter of taste.</td>', 'I''d never have known you tinted the background - it looks perfectly natural to me which means you did a great job not only applying a tint, but picking the right one.  I''d never even have thought of that.  To me, it''s just a little soft - I''d normally suspect camera shake (that''s my problem) but I see you''re using an IS lens.  May have been just a bit of movement by the birds themselves.  But soft isn''t always bad - often it''s a matter of taste.', '2006-12-09 15:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102448, 430719, 30982, '<td valign="top">Holy cow, that''s a perfect 5.0000!  Kind of a miniaccomplishment on it''s own.  I thought this a nice, well composed shot when I viewed it in the challenge.  I love the light, and wished the bug had crawled just a wee bit more into it - maybe half in and half out.  Composition is very nice and I like the muted colors, especially in the background.</td>', 'Holy cow, that''s a perfect 5.0000!  Kind of a miniaccomplishment on it''s own.  I thought this a nice, well composed shot when I viewed it in the challenge.  I love the light, and wished the bug had crawled just a wee bit more into it - maybe half in and half out.  Composition is very nice and I like the muted colors, especially in the background.', '2006-12-09 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102544, 433499, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot and very very underrated. The harmony of lighting and composition is impressive. Respect on such a fine image and I''m sorry it didn''t reach the placing it really deserved.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot and very very underrated. The harmony of lighting and composition is impressive. Respect on such a fine image and I''m sorry it didn''t reach the placing it really deserved.', '2006-12-09 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102555, 431533, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like what Julie did for the sky but you have to be careful with that in a challenge - essentially you''d be adding an element that''s not there.  I also like Falc''s suggestion to give it a bit more room on the left, though it does work for me the way it is.</td>', 'I do like what Julie did for the sky but you have to be careful with that in a challenge - essentially you''d be adding an element that''s not there.  I also like Falc''s suggestion to give it a bit more room on the left, though it does work for me the way it is.', '2006-12-09 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102584, 433551, 30982, '<td valign="top">The thing I find most interesting about this (other than Bucket''s comment, which is a story unto itself) is the fact it exists somewhere.  That there''s a store somewhere - undoubtedly a small one - where customers'' pictures hang next to the TicTacs.  Very smalltownish in a very non-smalltownish world.</td>', 'The thing I find most interesting about this (other than Bucket''s comment, which is a story unto itself) is the fact it exists somewhere.  That there''s a store somewhere - undoubtedly a small one - where customers'' pictures hang next to the TicTacs.  Very smalltownish in a very non-smalltownish world.', '2006-12-09 16:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102588, 427608, 30982, '<td valign="top">You did a great job with the gradient map - really adds life to this.  I agree with your sentiment about her looking out over the water - the composition you chose is a powerful one.  I also like how the distant shore is blurred, which accents the sharpness of the water and the silhouette.  Nice capture and very nice editing!  (And very nice score and finish, too.)</td>', 'You did a great job with the gradient map - really adds life to this.  I agree with your sentiment about her looking out over the water - the composition you chose is a powerful one.  I also like how the distant shore is blurred, which accents the sharpness of the water and the silhouette.  Nice capture and very nice editing!  (And very nice score and finish, too.)', '2006-12-09 16:19:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102591, 433261, 30982, '<td valign="top">This looks like something I''d take - I love scenes like this with the shadows and the light and the lines of the trees.  I like the curve of the road, too.  I suspect it didn''t score well or garner many comments because it''s plain - there''s no spark, so to speak.  Of course, when you''re actually there, it''s a lot different and that''s hard (for me, anyway) to translate into a picture.  One thing you could try (and I''m still not entirely all for it, but it has it''s uses) is HDR processing. If you shot it in RAW, you can do it from a single image.</td>', 'This looks like something I''d take - I love scenes like this with the shadows and the light and the lines of the trees.  I like the curve of the road, too.  I suspect it didn''t score well or garner many comments because it''s plain - there''s no spark, so to speak.  Of course, when you''re actually there, it''s a lot different and that''s hard (for me, anyway) to translate into a picture.  One thing you could try (and I''m still not entirely all for it, but it has it''s uses) is HDR processing. If you shot it in RAW, you can do it from a single image.', '2006-12-09 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102602, 433549, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has nice composition - I do like landscapes done in portrait mode, but the other comments you''ve received make some good points, especially as far as garnering votes here.  I went looking through your portfolio a bit and the one you should have entered is Colorado river 2 - that one has far more interesting light, and better color and contrast.  Definitely some gorgeous locations you''ve been shooting in!</td>', 'This has nice composition - I do like landscapes done in portrait mode, but the other comments you''ve received make some good points, especially as far as garnering votes here.  I went looking through your portfolio a bit and the one you should have entered is Colorado river 2 - that one has far more interesting light, and better color and contrast.  Definitely some gorgeous locations you''ve been shooting in!', '2006-12-09 16:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102624, 424289, 30982, '<td valign="top">You did a great job with the color in this - I especially like the patch of green grass near the center - kind of adds a spark to it.  I think the composition may have hurt the score for this one, though.  The one tree has a very dark side, and that with it''s reflection are right in the center of the picture.  Not sure you could get a lot closer unless you happened to have a boat handy, but maybe compose a bit more to the right or the left, depending on what was there.</td>', 'You did a great job with the color in this - I especially like the patch of green grass near the center - kind of adds a spark to it.  I think the composition may have hurt the score for this one, though.  The one tree has a very dark side, and that with it''s reflection are right in the center of the picture.  Not sure you could get a lot closer unless you happened to have a boat handy, but maybe compose a bit more to the right or the left, depending on what was there.', '2006-12-09 16:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102628, 432835, 30982, '<td valign="top">Check that out - no 1s or 2s and only one three - them''s good numbers.  I love shots like this - curves, lines, textures - all work together nicely here.  And as I see has already been mentioned, very nice DOF for this shot.</td>', 'Check that out - no 1s or 2s and only one three - them''s good numbers.  I love shots like this - curves, lines, textures - all work together nicely here.  And as I see has already been mentioned, very nice DOF for this shot.', '2006-12-09 16:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102637, 432119, 30982, '<td valign="top">In addition to what I said during the challenge, I also really like the DOF here - everything is crisp and clear - good clean Wyoming air.  Very nice shot and GREAT score and finish - congrats!</td>', 'In addition to what I said during the challenge, I also really like the DOF here - everything is crisp and clear - good clean Wyoming air.  Very nice shot and GREAT score and finish - congrats!', '2006-12-09 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102647, 433562, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - I like Don''s comment.  It does have energy, but I don''t think it''s from the crop; I think it''s from your subject, who radiates energy and light.  I suspect this wasn''t posed but a moment well caught.  So young, and already so perfectly color coordinated.  I like the single leaf on the sidewalk, too - gives a sense of time which is nice when taking pictures of children - they grow too quickly.</td>', 'Heh - I like Don''s comment.  It does have energy, but I don''t think it''s from the crop; I think it''s from your subject, who radiates energy and light.  I suspect this wasn''t posed but a moment well caught.  So young, and already so perfectly color coordinated.  I like the single leaf on the sidewalk, too - gives a sense of time which is nice when taking pictures of children - they grow too quickly.', '2006-12-09 17:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102655, 426645, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a complete portrait - the bird AND it''s environment.  The detail and color in the surroundings are excellent.  Of course that does mean that your bird doesn''t take center stage (and I''m pretty sure the bird prefers it that way so his prey doesn''t pay great attention to him) and that can dissuade some voters.  Still a pretty good score and no 1s, 2s, or 3s!</td>', 'To me, this is a complete portrait - the bird AND it''s environment.  The detail and color in the surroundings are excellent.  Of course that does mean that your bird doesn''t take center stage (and I''m pretty sure the bird prefers it that way so his prey doesn''t pay great attention to him) and that can dissuade some voters.  Still a pretty good score and no 1s, 2s, or 3s!', '2006-12-09 17:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102656, 431443, 18403, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!  Your IR image really shows off the foliage well.  How did you manage to keep the sky such a beautiful blue?</td>', 'Excellent work!  Your IR image really shows off the foliage well.  How did you manage to keep the sky such a beautiful blue?', '2006-12-09 17:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102657, 433408, 30982, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what Posthumous said in his comment - do you?  :-)  Very clever, very original, and nicely done, too!  Of course, I''d have to subtract a point for the fact that you''re young, in terrific shape, and have a terrific body - that''s simply not fair.  (And you do know I''m just teasing, right?)  Nice work, young lady!</td>', 'I have no idea what Posthumous said in his comment - do you?  :-)  Very clever, very original, and nicely done, too!  Of course, I''d have to subtract a point for the fact that you''re young, in terrific shape, and have a terrific body - that''s simply not fair.  (And you do know I''m just teasing, right?)  Nice work, young lady!', '2006-12-09 17:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102660, 433175, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot all around.  Excellent color, clarity, and nice DOF chosen for the shot.  Congrats on an excellent score in this challenge, too!</td>', 'This is an awesome shot all around.  Excellent color, clarity, and nice DOF chosen for the shot.  Congrats on an excellent score in this challenge, too!', '2006-12-09 17:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102784, 433311, 18339, '<td valign="top">I love this picture so much I cant stand it.  I wish my little girl was a baby again so I could do a shot like this! Congrats, very well done.</td>', 'I love this picture so much I cant stand it.  I wish my little girl was a baby again so I could do a shot like this! Congrats, very well done.', '2006-12-09 18:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3102854, 428673, 13077, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, it works really well. I never manage to pull off ''minimalist'' composed landscapes in color.</td>', 'I love the composition, it works really well. I never manage to pull off ''minimalist'' composed landscapes in color.', '2006-12-09 19:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
