(3103773, 433305, 23484, '<td valign="top">Hey Deb, This looks like a painting that should be hanging on a wall. This is a really nice shot. Rarely do you see a shot that is completely out of focus that turns out so nice. I think that the birds are more in-focus than the rest of the picture and it makes it look sharper than it really is.  Could you please write a tutorial on how to have these kinds of accidents?</td>', 'Hey Deb, This looks like a painting that should be hanging on a wall. This is a really nice shot. Rarely do you see a shot that is completely out of focus that turns out so nice. I think that the birds are more in-focus than the rest of the picture and it makes it look sharper than it really is.  Could you please write a tutorial on how to have these kinds of accidents?', '2006-12-10 10:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
