(3104274, 425028, 66384, '<td valign="top">You deserved better than the score you got, and you deserve at least one positive comment.<br/> <br/>This photo spoke to me, and I gave it a 6. I love seeing that a place like this still exists. Those two handicap signs (as big as the name of the town) are so silly, as if a person in a wheel chair couldn''t figure out they should use the ramp. I think this shot is amusing and charming.</td>', 'You deserved better than the score you got, and you deserve at least one positive comment. This photo spoke to me, and I gave it a 6. I love seeing that a place like this still exists. Those two handicap signs (as big as the name of the town) are so silly, as if a person in a wheel chair couldn''t figure out they should use the ramp. I think this shot is amusing and charming.', '2006-12-10 15:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
