(5174429, 426207, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  Appreciate inDEED!   It is breathtaking.   What I appreciate the most is how conditions have to be perfect to get good star photos.   There needs to be moonlight -- but not too much moonlight.  The moon has to be in the right place behind you.  There needs to be <i>some</i> but not too much light below.   I have tried many times -- but have never pulled off a really good starry night photo.  This is perfect!<br/></td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  Appreciate inDEED!   It is breathtaking.   What I appreciate the most is how conditions have to be perfect to get good star photos.   There needs to be moonlight -- but not too much moonlight.  The moon has to be in the right place behind you.  There needs to be some but not too much light below.   I have tried many times -- but have never pulled off a really good starry night photo.  This is perfect!', '2009-01-06 09:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
